<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Bɛkwyel</book>
  <para style="h">Malak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Malak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malak</para>
  <para style="imt">Mɛkpa mɛ mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="ip">Beeka Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Yezu Klisto Malak nakaada tɔ mɛkana mɛ ɛ. Malak nabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ eYuda nakan ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb bhii bɛ nagwak Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu ɛ. Nyɛ nakwyal mɛkana mɛ embɛɛ etɛp bak ɛ́, é sok bot nadi, bɛ dinaa ààmyaal Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Beeka Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Malak nakwyal bot ɛ namyaal Zɛɛb nadi ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal na dhen. Nyɛy ààkaada etɛp ee edhɔma ɛ Yezu. Ye tok pe nɛ etɛp ee na dulal-dulal Yezu nadi elii nɛ bot ɛ tɔ tak. Tin, tɔ tak wɔ waabela bɛtɛ nɛ edi ee nyɛ nakaada bhoma Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot, dáa nyɛ nadi etsik bot ɛ, nɛ elɛŋ bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot. É bɛdhiiti edi e sis, nyɛ kaada ɛ́ bɛdhiiti etɛp ee di ààdi tɔ bɛdhiiti bɛmɛkana mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Malak nakwyal ɛ zobaadu ɛ́ ɛzel ɛ wat nɛ bɛmɛkana mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal elɛl yii mɛkɛn. Tin, nyɛ nakaada yɛ ɛ dáa puugɛ. Kana mɛkpa mɛ mɛkɛn, nyɛ lyaal bot Yezu ɛ́ dáa Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Pɛ kyee mɛsik mɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nyɛ kake ɛ́ náá, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb eegwyɛ bema é Mɛlaaba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:39">15.39</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ tɔ ɛtsek ɛ mɛkɛn mɛ mɛkana mɛ Malak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-8:26">1.1–8.26</ref></char>), Yezu ààkwyɛl náá, bot leegu mot nyɛ nadi ɛ. Nyɛ nadi etsik membel, esɔ embee esisim tɔ bot, nyɛ nadi elii ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ. Bot nadi edji-dji náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa mot?» Tin, Yezu nadi eke nɛ bot ɛ́ di egek náá, bɛ nɛ gu nyɛ ɔ náá: «Nàlɛɛka bot, mot mɛ di ɛ.»</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɛ tɔ yak pes mɛkana kalik ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:27-16:20">8.27–16.20</ref></char>) lyaal ɛ́ dáa Yezu di Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bot ɛ mɛl mɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Lɔm naduduwal ekukuma bɔɔ ɛ́ dáa bɛzɛɛb. Bot ɛ tak nadi esa bɛtɛ nɛ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ, bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɛngék ɛ bot, etɛp djas bot nadi ezyɛ bɛ nɛ yɛ ɛ, bɛ nadi ekwak.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ghuna Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb, myaala nyɛ namyaal mot nɛ esesɛɛ bɛ djas, nɛ dáa nyɛ nalooba nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Ye naasa náá, nyɛ zuk da nyɛ ɛ́ gwyɛ. Dɔɔ nɛ náá, bɛdjekel bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààleenyɔ ɛgu yɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadhuugal nyɛ, é sok ye nakeaa náá, nyɛ waagóaa ɛ. Tin, dhiiti kukuma esodja e Lɔm ɛ nake náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mot'ak nabɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb», é sok nyɛ nabee dáa Yezu nasil eswos ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">É sok Yezu di elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ met ɛ, nyɛ dyeebake ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ mot Zɛɛb nadjɛ ghwyil djas ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ ghwyil ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot, nɛ ɛpel ɛ mesyem ɔ. Mɛkpa mɛ tak baakwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, tsɛɛtsɛ nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot. Ye lyaal ɛ́ mot mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ, nɛ lwomel nyɛ nazyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Malak nakwyal ɛ, dji ɛ́ kiya náá: «Yezu ɛ́ zɛ?» Mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbɔɔza é di'enek. Mɛkana mɛ Malak lyaal ɛ́ mɛze mɛ Yezu nadhaa é tak ɛ. Ye ɛpekwyee bot étɛp bɛ neegu batsa-batsa mot Yezu nadi ɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ɛkɛn ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ Yezu Klisto, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tɔ bɛtɛ nɛ Ekwyala nakwyalel sok ɛ, Ekwyala bak tok tɔ bɛdhiiti tak.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Dáa Ekwyala di elɛɛ tɔ mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Mam Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadhis ngoola-ngoola yam pɛ sok bhwoob'ɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">étɛp nyɛ neekoobal wɔ mɛze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Yɛ ɛ́ gwood mot di etuud kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Nyɛ nakeke nɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Koobalka mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Tuuka nyɛ mɛze mɛ na looba-looba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Eza 40.3</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Tin, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot eezɛzyɛ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, nyɛy etuud náá: «Liigka elyem, da bi ɛ́ kɛduwa Zɛɛb. Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waapel mesyem men.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Tin, bot ɛ kyee dik Yude djas nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm lɔɔg wat, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ, kɛvaa mesyem mɔɔ é mis mɛ bot, nɛ ɛduwa Zɛɛb tɔ dii Yuldɛn.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Kaad Zaŋ nadi ebɔt ɛ nasael ɛ́, nɛ mya mɛ boo yaaga bal. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bhɛtɛ ket é kuu. Nyɛ nadedɛ ɛ́ etsemaaka nɛ ego. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nyɛ nadi elyo mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk ɛ́ náá: «Mot di ezyɛ bhii mam ɔ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛ nɛ mɛbwala. Mam aanàkwaakobela-belak duu ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel e ekoko bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mam duu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ pɛ tɔ dii. Yɛ kabɛ nyɛy ɔɔ, nyɛ aaduu bin Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ Sisim na Dɛɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛduwa Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛbhowal ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Tin, tɔ mɛlu menek, Yezu naazɛdus pɛ Nazalɛt, pɛ kyee dik Ghalile, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dii Yuldɛn, étɛp nyɛ neekɛduwa Zɛɛb pɛ daa Zaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />É ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi ewyis tɔ dii ɛ, wɔ gwaa, gwoo zɛbɛŋel. Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛsul kɔ lɛ tyee ɛghum.<verse eid="MRK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Gwood wat zɛgék tɔ gwoo eke náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ. Bum lyem'am ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />É di tak wat, Sisim Zɛɛb eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yezu naazɛsa tin pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, mɛlu mɛkam-mɛná. Satan naawa nyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ bɛtit ɛ dik. Efofop nadi ezɛdjɛ nyɛ sa nyɛ nadi ekwos ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo ekan ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, Zaŋ naazɛmɛtaa é mbok. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu naazɛtɔ́ pɛ Ghalile kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb. Nyɛy náá: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />«Ɛwala Zɛɛb nakɛk ɛ, yɛ eezekum! Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe. Liigka elyem, myaalka Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel ɛná</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yezu nadi ekɛ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbee bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet bɛbá, Simɔŋ bɛ nɛ dhyeeb Andele ela mɛwyet tɔ dii. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Duka mɛ, mɛ waasa náá, bi di bɛlael ɛ mɛwyet étɛp ɛmɛt ɛ bot.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />É di'enek wat, bɛ eezɛdhuugal mɛwyet mɔɔ, étɛp ɛdu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Bhii Yezu nakɛ ba ziii ɛ, nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ Zak bɛ nɛ dhyeeb Zaŋ, bɔn Zɛbɛdɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́, mendiindil tɔ elɛɛd e bɔɔ sela é ɛboŋ, bɔɔ ekoobal mɛwyet mɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Batsa deenek, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdhuugal sɛɛg'ɔɔ Zɛbɛdɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ tɔ elɛɛd, du nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eelyo bot tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛni kɔ dɛl Kapɛlnaum dwoo saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dwoo saba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dwoo ɛwala ɛ eYuda. </char></note>. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛni tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Nyɛ eezɛben gwood elyo Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ nadi edjoka kɔkɔ mbi yenek lyoa Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nalelyo ɛ́, nɛ eghɛŋ, ààkabɛ dáa bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz di ezezyɛ nɛ ɛlelyo sok ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />É di tak wat, tɔ bot ɛ nadi tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot mbee sisim nadi dhedhek nyɛ ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛkyeeb náá: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Haaa! Mena ɛ́ nɛ yaa tɛp, Yezu, mot Nazalɛt? Iyeee! Wɔ zyɛ ɛ́ zɛtwak bis é? Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔy ɛ́ Mot na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbhɛm nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛy náá: «Dia gwyem, wyisa tɔ nyel mot'ak!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mbee sisim zokazɛdheeg mot'enɔk ɛlyelɛpe. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ lɛ nɛ boo tsim. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bot djas naadjoka ɛlyelɛpe, bhii tak bɛ moo edjinel pak'ɔɔ: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi kɔkɔ lyoel di elyo nɛ eghɛŋ djas'aak? Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ nɛ ghwyil ɛbatake nɛ embee esisim náá, bɛ wyis, bɔɔ batagwak nyɛ, da wyis!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />É di tak wat, dék din ɛ lɛ zokakɛ kɔ kyee dik Ghalile djas.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik tsi ɛ Simɔŋ yii moma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Wyisa Yezu nawyis tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Simɔŋ nɛ Andele, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Zak zɛnɔɔ Zaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bɛ kabela tin ɛ́, tsi ɛ Simɔŋ yii moma kpop nɛ mɛkosa ndjaasi. Kuma nyɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yezu zɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛmalal, mɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, wyɛl nyɛ. É di tak wat, mɛkosa eezɛsi tɔ lɛ. Tin, tsi ɛ Simɔŋ eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ moo zɛbe bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik zukamwaa nɛ mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Bikoko, dwoo eezesila, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ dɛl zokazyɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ membi nɛ membi, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bot ɛ mɛl djas zokazɛmaala é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ ɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Tin, Yezu naazɛtsik bɛtɛ nɛ membel membi nɛ membi nazyɛ ɔ, nyɛ naabaasɔ embee esisim tɔ bɛdhiiti. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbet náá, embee esisim gheelii, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi egwyak nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtɔ́ kɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ kyee dik Ghalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Tɔ ghooghom mɛlem mɛ yak ɛlu, Yezu eezɛkuud tɔ́ pɛ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, étɛp ɛkɛdjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simɔŋ nɛ bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ eezɛtɔ́ kɛsaa nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Bhii bɛ nakabela nyɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bot djas ɛpesaa wɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djhookaka pɛ yii mɛl etɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ kɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb penek, etɛɛ náá, mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Bhii tak, Yezu zokakɛ kɔ kyee dik Ghalile djas, egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ ɛsɔ embee esisim tɔ bot.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Dhiiti mot nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɔ, zokazɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, kwyit mɛboŋ si, zɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik mɛ, lyem'ɔ ɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ, étɛp mɛ neebula nyel dɛɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Wɔ gwaa, ghoŋ zɛmɛt Yezu ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛ eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ, mɛt nyɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ eekwyɛl, tsaka!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />É di tak wat, ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam zokasi é nyel mot'enɔk, nyɛ moo dɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Bhii tak, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛswaal mot'enɔk é di tak wat. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdul nyɛ mɛlɔ ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe! Sa wɔ ààlɛɛ mot sa dhaa wak ɛ. Tɔ́ kɛlyaal nyel'ɔ pɛ daa bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛdjɛ ebuwa e bɛtit étɛp ɛdis edhuud dáa Moiiz nake ɛ, tin, wɔ neelyaal nɛ bot náá, wɔ eetsak.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mot'enɔk eezɛtɔ́, nyɛ ààpakadi gwyem. Nyɛ moo elɛɛ nɛ bot egba nɛ egba sa dhaŋ ɛ. Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naalyel nɛ Yezu nyɛ tuula kɔ dɛl. Nyɛ nazokadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. Bot nadi edus pɛ ekyee sis, zyɛ pɛ daa lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nyel nazesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, Yezu eezɛbula pɛ Kapɛlnaum. Dáa bot nagwak náá, nyɛ ɛ́ pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zɛsɛɛga kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ. Mɛbu mɛ bot saa-saŋak di ɛsɛɛ mɛtel. Bot kum-kumak pɛ ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa. Tin, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́, elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Bɛdhiiti bot zokazyɛ nɛ mot ngɔt, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eezesɔɔb nɛ ɛbɛ́. Bot ɛná ɛ́ nabyaal nyɛ kɔ mwaala. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Dáa ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi ɛbuɛpe, ààbɛ nɛ ze ɛkpaa étɛp bɛ neekɛnɛɛg nyɛ si mɛko ɛ Yezu ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bot binɔk zokazɛtuu ɛlen kɔ mii ndjaa, bɛ eezɛsil mwaala mot ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak.<figure style="fig" alt="Un malade a été fait passé par le toit de la maison" file="42_Mark2.4_ParalyzedManLoweredThroughRoof.tif" size="col" loc="2.4" copy="Gordon Thompson " ref="2.4">Mot ɛbɛ eekwyɛɛgaa kɔ mii ndjaa</figure><verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ nɛ mbel tak ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ mot nazesɔɔb ɔ náá: «Mɔn'am, mesyem mɔ eepelel.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nadi mendiindil tin ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ esiiza tɔ elyem bɔɔ. Bɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Mot'ak lii deenek étɛp yé? Nyɛ ɛpebyasal Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ sɔ mot, bhii Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet.» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />É di tak wat, Yezu naagu esiiza bɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ mbi yenek egeka? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ɛye di elyel nɛ nen, ɛke ɛ́ nɛ mbel náá: “Mesyem mɔ eepelel” ohoo, nɛghu ɛke ɛ́ náá: “Wyɛla, ghɛɛa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel mesyem mɛ bot kɔ bɔs.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot nazesɔɔb ɔ náá: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Mɛ ke ɛ́ náá: Wyɛla, nɔŋa mwaala yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ sik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />É di'enek wat, bot djas dhuuu nɛ mis é nyel'ɛ, mbel eezɛwyɛl, ghɛɛ mwaala yɛ, zɛnɔɔ nyel tɔ́. Bot djas naadyeebadjoka. Bhii tak, bɛ moo eduwal Zɛɛb é ɛkeke náá: «Mena dinaa ààpabee kɔkɔ yak sok!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezesɛɛ Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yezu eebaazɛsik mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Bot mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu nadi ezyɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Tin, nyɛy elelyo bɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Dáa nyɛ nadi edhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbee Levi, mɔn ɛ Alfe, ndiindel é di mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɔŋel epata e lapo. Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dua mɛ!» Tin, ngbat, Levi eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ eezɛdu nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛtɔ́, kɛdɛ edee pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Levi. É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo, nɛ bot ɛ mesyem, etɛɛ náá, kwaambi bot binɔk nadi edudu nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. Dɔɔ nɛ bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu pe nadi ɛ́ tin. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi yii eFalizyɛ, nadi ebee dáa nyɛ nadi edɛ edee é di wat, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo ɛ. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Étɛp yé nyɛ di edɛ edee é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔŋel ɛ epata e lapo nɛ bot ɛ di nɛ embee mɛfulu ɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yezu naagwak dáa bɛ nadi elii ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ di mɛnyel ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ, tok nɛ gwyes ngwomel bot étɛp nyɛ neegwom bɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ membel ɛ di nɛ gwyes mɛgwoma. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ zɛsaa bot ɛ epiki. Mɛ nazyɛ ɛ́ zɛsaa bot ɛ di egu náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mesyem ɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ tɛp ɛtsi edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Dhiiti dwoo, bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ, bɛ nɛ eFalizyɛ nadi etsi edee étɛp mendjaala. Tin, bot naazɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ nɛ yii eFalizyɛ di etsi edee, da bɔ kadi ɛ́, ààtsi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zokabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nakobee sok paa náá, bɛsɔ ɛ mwaaz tsi edee é dwoo ɛba, dhi bɛ di lɔɔg wat nɛ mwaaz, mot paazyɛ, zɛba moma ɔ? Mam ààbee. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ɛwala ɛ tak ɛ́ waakum, é sok yɛ aadi náá, mwaaz mot zyɛzɛsa ɛbá ɔ aadisaa tɔ lɔɔ ɔ. É di tak ɛ́ bɛ aakatsi edee.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ye tok nɛ mot aanyaa pes bes kaad étɛp ɛkoobal ɛ bet kaad nɛ yɛ. Wɔ sa deenek ɔɔ, é sok wɔ aagwyii kaad tak ɛ, bes kaad ɛ́ waanyaa bet kaad, da yɛ ɛ́ bek ɛlen ɛ tak. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ye tok nɛ mot aawa bes mɛnyok tɔ bhɛɛb na mwa, etɛɛ náá, ye wyil ɔɔ, mɛnyok ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbo bhɛɛb, da mot ɛ́ su mɛnyok, su dɔɔ nɛ bhɛɛb. Ààbɛ! Yɛ ààgoka deenek etɛɛ náá, mɛnyok mɛ na bes goka ɛ́ tɔ ebes e bhɛɛb.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ kukuma dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Dhiiti dwoo saba, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi edhaa tɔ pyeeb kɔkɔ mbi bhek bhusa di edjóoaa ble ɛ. Bɔɔ kuku kyeed, bɛdjekel moo tin, ebɔ́k mɛzɛm mɛ tak. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />EFalizyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Beea etɛp ee bɛ di esa dwoo saba ɛ, yɛ ààpadjɛaa bɛ ze náá, bɛ sa deenek.» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa ààpalaa dáa Dhavid nasa é sok bɛ nɛ bot bɛ nadi tɔ mezuk, ààbɛ nɛ sa dek ɛ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Bɛ naani tɔ pɛt ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ́, kɛdɛ emapa ee nakaŋaa Zɛɛb yɛ ɛ. É ghɛŋ tak, yɛ ɛ́ Abiyataad ɛ nadi boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Ye nakoozodi náá, etsi lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, mot di egoka nɛ ɛdɛ emapa binek ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ ghaa-Zɛɛb. Tin, mɛkoozi Dhavid naadɛ yɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ naanɔɔ yak kyee, djɛ bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yezu zokabaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zɛɛb nasa dwoo saba ɛ́, étɛp bot, ààkabɛ náá, nyɛ nasa mot ɛ́ étɛp saba. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot di kukuma dwoo saba.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eetsik mot na sɔɔbela mbɔ dwoo saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Bhii tak, Yezu eebaazɛsik tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Tɔ tak, ye nadi ɛ́, nɛ dhiiti mot ngɔt nɛ mbɔ sɔɔbela. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bot moo tinaak dhuuu nɛ mis é nyel ɛ Yezu egwyak nɛghu nyɛ waatsik nyɛ é dwoo saba, étɛp bɛ neepit nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ mot na mbɔ sɔɔbela yenɔk náá: «Wyɛla, dha! Tyaŋa tetel kuku ɛbwak.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Nyɛ eezɛdji ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ: «Tɔ etsi, ɛyé di egoka nɛ ɛsael dwoo saba, enɛm esa ohoo, embee esesɛɛ? Ɛtsik ɛ mot ohoo, nɛghu ɛbet náá, mot gwyɛ?» Tin, bot djas moo tinaak mɔɔɔ, ààbɔɔza nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yezu eezɛbulal mis, gwyák bɛ nɛ ɛbuk tɔ lyem, nyel tsak nyɛ wɔyɔŋ nɛ mbi yenek mɛlyel mɛ elyem mɛ bot ɛ tak. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ mot tak náá: «Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ.» Nyɛ eezɛsɛɛb mbɔ'ɛ, wɔ gwaa, mbɔ'ɛ tak zɛsekel bula ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />EFalizyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Tin, bɛ eezɛsɛɛga nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga ɛ mɛkoozi Eelood. Bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ́ boozɛni é boob, étɛp ɛdjek dáa bɛ aasa étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛdhuu ɛ bot eezɛdu Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛtɔ́ mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot zɛdu nyɛ. Bot ɛ tak nadudus ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude nɛ pɛ Ghalile, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />nɛ dɛl ɛ Yeluzalɛm, nɛ pɛ kyee dik Edhume, nɛ pɛ kyee dik yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn, zɛnɔɔ pɛ kyee dik Tiid nɛ Sidɔn. Bɛ nadi ezyɛ mɛdhuu-mɛdhuu etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ egwak menduk mɛ sa nyɛ nasa ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9-10" />Dáa nyɛ naadi etsik membel ɛbuɛpe ɛ, bɛdhiiti nasuu ɛ́, bɛ ghaaga nyɛ é nyel, étɛp bɔɔ bɛmet neemɛt nyɛ nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ, bɛ neetsak. Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boolɛɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ nɔɔ nyɛ dhiiti elɛɛd étɛp nyɛ neeni tɔ tak, ekaab náá, bot ɛzɛkɛbila nyɛ é nyel. <verse eid="MRK 3:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />É sok bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ, nadi ebee nyɛ ɛ, bɛ nadi ekwyit mɛboŋ si, si mɛko mɛ, etsim náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yezu ɛ́ bozɛlyak bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá, bɛ nàsa náá, bot gu mbi mot nyɛ nadi ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsɛ́ɛ bot ɛ lwoma yɛ kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok. Nyɛ eedjóo bot ɛ nyɛ nasɛ́ɛ ɔ, wɔ gwaa bot ɛ tak zokazyɛ pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsɛɛ tɔ sama yɔɔ bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ bɛbá yii nyɛ aadi egyee nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neekyeed bɛ, bɛ kɛlyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />dɔɔ nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛ eghɛŋ yii ɛsɔ embee esisim. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Beeka min mɛ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá tak é: Simɔŋ, mot Yezu naget Pyɛɛd ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zak nɛ dhyeeb Zaŋ, bɔɔ djas bɔn Zɛbɛdɛ. Yezu naget bɛ din ɛ Bhoanɛɛghɛs, ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́: bot ɛ di dáa ndum bhi ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Filip, Bhaatelemi, Matye, Toma, Zak mɔn Alfe, Tade, Simɔŋ mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edjóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />zɛnɔɔ Yudas Iskaliɔt, mot di náá, nyɛ aaka Yezu gha ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Yezu eetɔ́ kɛsaa Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛsik pɛ ndjaa. Wɔ gwaa zukamwaa nɛ mot zɛlwood kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ, ààbɛ nɛ dáa bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ dɛ edee. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Dáa bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, bɛ ghɛɛ, tɔ́, kɛsaa nyɛ, bɛ neebula nɛ nɛ etɛɛ náá, tɔ elo bɔɔ, bɛ nadi egek ɛ náá: «Yezu ɛpebɛ́ mɛlyet.»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛbhekel mɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadus pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ leega nɛ Bɛlzebul, kukuma embee esisim djas.» Bɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ kukuma embee esisim ɛ di edjɛ kɔkɔ yak mbi mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esɔ embee esisim nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />É di'enek, Yezu eezɛdjóo bɛ. Nyɛ eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ kana. Nyɛy náá: «Satan ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsɔ nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet é? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ wat ɛ́ ɛwaya pak'ɔɔ ɔɔ, ɛyoŋ ɛ tak aanàkwaadi. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Baabela náá, bɔn bil wat ɛ di egónel pak'ɔɔ ɔɔ, bil tak aanàkwaadi. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, Satan ɛ twak nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet ɔɔ, nyɛ wa zyaala tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ ɔɔ, tin, nyɛ aanàkwaabaabɛ nɛ ghwyil, ɛsi ɛ lɛ'enek.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ye tok nɛ mot di nɛ ghwyil ɛni tɔ ndjaa mot mɛnyan, da nɔɔ esa bɛ, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ dinaa ààpamɛt nyɛ sok, da kɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ nɛ mɛko ɔɔ. Tin ɛ, nyɛ aadjala nɛ ɛnɔɔ esa e ndjaŋ'ɛ djas, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyis, tɔ́. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mesyem mɛ bot djas ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpelaa, ye nakoozodi ebyas djas bɛ byasal Zɛɛb ɛ nɛ mesyem mɔɔ djas. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot eebyasal Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaapelaa, etɛɛ náá, yenek ɛ́ syem na kɔm-kɔm.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yezu nalii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi eke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mbee sisim ɛ di tɔ lɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tɛtɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg eezɛkum, bɛ eezɛtyaa pɛ kel, ààni tɔ ndjaa. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛlwom mot, nyɛ kɛdjóo Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Etɛɛ náá, zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi ɛ́ mendiindil nyɛy kuku ɛbwak. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlɛɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Nyoog nɛ bɛdhyeeb bɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛkɛl bɔ ɛ́ pɛ kel. Bɛ ɛpesaa wɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nyaagam ɛ́ zɛ? Da bɔn-nyaagam ɛ́ kadi bɛzɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ bulal mis, gwyák ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk djas. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke náá: «Beeka nyaagam nɛ bɔn-nyaagam di wak é. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Etɛɛ náá, mot di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ di mɔn-nyaagam, kɛl'am nɛ nyaagam.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kana sɔsel mɛbhek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa Yezu baazɛni elyo bot mbaka-mbaka nɛ boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. Tin, zukamwaa nɛ mot naazɛsɛɛga tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛni tɔ dhiiti elɛɛd. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, disi. Elɛɛd nadi ɛ́ tɔ dii, bot kadi ɛ́ pɛ kyiid é ngwoob dii. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Nyɛ naalyo bɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlyo tɔ ekana. Tɔ dhiiti kana, nyɛ nake nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Gwakeka! Dhiiti dwoo mot ngɔt naatɔ́ pɛ pyeeb'ɛ, kɛsɔs bhek. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Dáa nyɛ nadi esɔs bhek ɛ, kyee bhek wat nakwyit ɛ́, é gba, wɔ gwaa, enen zokazyɛ, zɛdɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Yak kyee bhek kakwyit ɛ́, kɔ bat ɛkok. Ààkobɔya deenek, mɛbhek eezɛkwyil etɛɛ náá, di tak nadi ɛ́, nɛ ba bim ebɔs. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Bhii tak, gwyes na “ghɛ-ghɛ” eezɛkɛɛza kɔ mɛbhek menek, wɔ gwaa, mɛbhek djas zɛsyee etɛɛ náá, ekaŋal e tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààni tɔ bɔs ɛdimɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Dhiiti kyee bhek nakwyit ɛ́ tɔ engwyinini. Engwyinini binek wyee, kala kɔ embɛɛ mɛbhek, ààbɛ nɛ dáa mɛbhek wyee ɛnyɔɛpe. Mɛbhek kadi ɛ́, ààwum. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Tin, dhiiti kyee bhek nakwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɔ naakwyil ɛnyɔɛpe, wɔ gwaa, ye kwyil mɛzɛm. É kwos wat, bhum mɛkam-mɛlɛl, é yak kwos bhum mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat, é dhiiti kwos bhum dhet.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Bhii tak, Yezu zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Étɛp yé Yezu di elyo tɔ ekana?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />É sok bɛ nadi bɛ nɛ Yezu bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ, bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ Yezu ɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá, naazɛdji nyɛ ɛsuk ɛ ekana binek. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ, bi eezedjɛaa etsoŋ ɛgu ɛ ɛsuk ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ kabɛ bɛsɔ bin ɔɔ, bɛ gwak yɛ ɛ tɔ ekana. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Deenek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwyák nɛ mis, ààbee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwak nɛ mɛlɔ, ààmɛt sa ye di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">ekaab náá, bɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbula dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">da bɛ ɛ́ bela ɛpelak ɛ Zɛɛb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6.9-10</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu moo elɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ kana tak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààtiibal ɛsuk ɛ kana yak ɛnyɔɛpe? “Aah” bi aagwak ɛsuk ɛ bak bɛdhiiti ekana dáa? Gwakeka ɛsuk ɛ tak: <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Sɔsel mɛbhek kɛsɔs ɛ́ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek mɛ di é ngwoob egba é di Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb kwyit ɔ. Nɛ ɛgwak ɛ bɛ zogwak ɛ, Satan eeleezyɛ, zɛnɔɔ bɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak tɔ ebhum elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Tin, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ kyee bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di dáa mɛbhek kwyit kɔ bat ɛkok ɔ. Dáa bɛ gwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ myaal nɛ mɛmyaala djas. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Tin, bɛ ààbet náá, mɛkpa mɛ tak gheeni bɛ ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ ebhum elyem, bɛ ààwa zii ɛbuɛpe. É ghɛŋ mezuk nɛ mɛtiiga aatuula bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ɛliig ɛ lɔɔ Zɛɛb koŋ ààbɔya. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bɛdhiiti tɔ lɔɔ gwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ dáa kyee bhek nakwyit tɔ engwyinini ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />tin, ɛwa lyem tɔ ɛsiiza esa e bɔs'ak, ɛwyeeb ɛ mɛvu, nɛ egwyes e esonok mbɛs ɛ́ di enyal Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ elyem bɔɔ. Tin, ye kadi ɛ́, ààdjɛ bhum. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bɛdhiiti bot kadi ɛ́ dáa mɛbhek mɛ kwyit kɔ mbɛɛ bɔs ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di egwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, myaal yɛ nɛ lyem wat, da bɛ ɛ́ kɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Tin, bɛ waadjɛ bhum ɛbuɛpe, yak mɛkam-mɛlɛl, yak tak mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat, yak dhet.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana lama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil zyɛ nɛ lama, da nyɛ ɛ́ butal si bhwaa, nɛghu ɛnɔɔ yɛ, da wa pɛ si goŋ é? Ye nɛɛgaa ɛ́ pɛ kɔ tɛɛg, etsal é? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ye tok nɛ sa ɛsɔ aadi àànyen é mwos dwoo. Esa e mɛsɔ djas aadi ɛ́, nyen é gwyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Bɛɛka mɛlɔ men, yɛ bɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak ɔɔ, gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Bhii yenek, Yezu eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ dum nɛ etɛp djas mɛ di elɛɛ bin ɛ! Dáa bi di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, é di tak wat, nyɛ waabil bin ɛgu. Nyɛ aalwoodal bhwaŋ'en ɛ dáa bi di elwoodal bhwaa bɛsɔ bin ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waalwoodal bin yɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mot aadi nɛ ba bim sonok ɔ, bɛ aabil nyɛ dhiiti. Yɛ kabɛ mot di ààbɛ nɛ sonok ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaabela sonok. Ba bim nyɛ aadi nɛ yɛ ɛ, yɛ waadɛkaa djas.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana mɛbhek di ekwyil nyɛ ɛmet ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛke náá: «Beeka sa di enɔŋel nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ: dhiiti mot zokakɛmwam mɛbhek é bɔs. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Bhii tak, nyɛ nakoodi é gɔ, nɛghu nyɛ kadi ɛ́ ndjem mwos nɛ pum, mɛbhek ɛpekwyil nɛ ɛwyee tɔ pyeeb. Bela náá, nyɛy ààgu dáa ye di esɛ́ɛ penek ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kabela tin ɛ, mbɛɛ bɔs ɛ di esa náá, embɛɛ mɛbhek menek kwyil nɛ ɛwyee ɛnyɔɛpe. Ye Kan ɛ́ ɛtuu ɛ bɔs, zyɛ, kum le, bhii tak zɛdjɛ mɛzɛm mɛ na bes, batadjɛ bhum mɛbhisa. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Tin, é di yɛ aakabɛ náá, bhisa eezesɔk ɛ, nyɛ kazyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛlando, zɛkan mɛsa mɛ ɛdis ɛ bhisa tak.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana bɔɔ mɛbhek di edjóoaa «mutaad» ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛke náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aakɔa nɛ yaa mbi sa? Tɔ yaa kana mena aadjala nɛ ɛtel Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ dáa bhek le di edjɛ bhum di edjóoaa mutaad ɛ. É sok bɛ di ebɛ yɛ tɔ bɔs ɛ, nyɛ eedhaa mɛbhek djas kɔ bɔs nɛ mɛtɔɔl. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ eebɛaa ɔɔ, nyɛ waakwyil, mɛwyee mɛ ɛ́ dhaa ele ee di tɔ mɔɔ bok ɛ djas. Nyɛ waakwyil boo elɛɛ djala náá, enen lóo mɛk mɔɔ kɔ ebhuuz e tak.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Deenek, yɛ ɛ́ tɔ kɔkɔ mbi ekana binek ɛ Yezu nadi lelyo bot. Nyɛ nalelɛɛ bɛ ɛ́, yii baadjala nɛ ɛmɛt ɛsuk ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààlii nɛ bot, ààbɛ nɛ kana tɔ sa nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. Yɛ kabɛ é sok nyɛ nadi bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ, nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ mɛsuk mɛ ekana binek djas.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlyak ghuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Bikoko dwoo tak wat, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Djhoosɛɛka pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bɛ eezɛlik ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́ sama wat nɛ Yezu tɔ boo elɛɛd. Tin, bɛdhiiti mɛlɛɛd nadi ɛ́, é ngwoob'ɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Ààbɔya deenek, kasɛka ɛ́ boo ghuu ɛlyelɛpe eezɛkan, ghulal tak eeghɛɛ ɛbhyeeb ɛ mɛdii kɛɛza é elɛɛd, elɛɛd moo tin eni mɛdii, ɛkɛɛ yɛ aalwood-lwooda. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Tin, Yezu, pɛ ɛsik ɛ elɛɛd, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, é gɔ́, lo kɔ boola. Bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛdjem nyɛ nɛ etsim. Bɔɔ náá: «Lyoel, mena ɛ́ di esikaa. Yɛ ààgwyák wɔy é?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Tin, Yezu eezɛdjem. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlyak ghuu. Nyɛy nɛ dii náá: «Sila ghulal'ɔ. Dia gwyem!» É di'enek, ghuu eezɛsila, bhwak moo tin kup.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus a arrêté la tempête" file="WA03848b.tif" size="span" loc="4.39" copy="Graham Wade" ref="4.39">Yezu eelyak ghuu nɛ bhuuge</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di nɛ kɛŋ? Bi ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb é?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bwoo naasa bɛ ɛlyelɛpe, bɛ moo edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ nwyaa kwaambi mot di náá, dɔɔ nɛ ghuu nɛ boo soob na djato-djato ɛpegwak nyɛ'aak?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eetsik dhiiti mot nadi nɛ mbee sisim ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛsɛɛ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Gheelaasa. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Dáa nyɛ nadi esul tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, kasɛka ɛ́ dhiiti mot edus tɔ mɛvit, ezyɛ zɛsaa tyee nyɛ aaboma nɛ nɛ. Embee esisim ɛ nadi edhek mot tak. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mot tak nadidi ɛ́ tɔ mɛvit. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ mot aakwak ɛmɛt nyɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɔl nyɛ nɛ ekel e ghwooz. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Etɛɛ náá, sok, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eewaaa mɛko é mbwak, kɔlaa mɛmbɔ nɛ eghwooz. Tin, nyɛ naabwak mbwak, dɔɔ nɛ ɛtsaal eghwooz. Ye tok nɛ mot aakwak ɛmɛt nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Mɛlu djas, mwos nɛ pum nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ tɔ mɛvit nɛ kɔ mɛtsok, etsim nɛ ɛbaal ɛ́ nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet nɛ mɛkok.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ɛtsetaɛpe pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛbee Yezu, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ sum kaab, zɛghaaga mɛboŋ si, sok bhwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Nyɛ eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Mɛ sa wɔ yé, Yezu, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake? Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ nɛ din ɛ Zɛɛb, nàtwak mɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Nyɛ nadi eke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Yezu naake náá: «Mbee sisim, wyisa tɔ mot'ak!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zokazɛdji nyɛ: «Din ɛ lɔ ɛ́ yé?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Din ɛ lam ɛ́ “Mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm” etɛɛ náá, bis nɛ bu.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Nàsɔ bis ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ kyee dik'ak!»<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />É di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee nadi egɔɔ kɔ mɛtsok menek ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Embee esisim eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu, bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Kyeeda bis tɔ bɛghwyee bak. Lɛɛa náá, bis ni tɔ mɛnyel mɔɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yezu zokazɛmyaal bɛ yɛ ɛ. Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛwyis tɔ mot'enɔk, ni tɔ ɛsaŋ ɛ bɛghwyee binɔk. Bɛ nadi ɛ́, ɛbuɛpe tyee bɛghwyee bɛmil ɛbá. Bɔɔ djas zɛsul ɛtsok pɛ bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ ekaab. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛges, kɛghaaga tɔ dii, diida. Bɔɔ djas si na bhɛɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Bot ɛ nadi ebee edjema binek djas ɔ, zokasik nɛ ekaab, kɛlɛɛ bot kɔ dɛl nɛ tɔ epyeeb. Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛtɛ nɛ bot zokazyɛ, zɛbee sa nasael ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ kyee Yezu nadi ɛ. Tin, bɔɔ zokazɛbee mot embee esisim mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm nadi edhedhek ɔ, ndiindel nɛ ekaad é nyel. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyel ɛnyɔɛpe. Wɔ gwaa, bwoo zɛmɛt bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bot ɛ nabee edjema binek djas ɔ, moo tin ebaŋa bot dáa mot na embee esisim mɛkɔm-mɛkɔm natsak ɛ, nɛ dáa bɛghwyee nakɛghaaga tɔ dii ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Étɛp tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjaala nɛ Yezu, bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Dusa kɔ kyee dik'es. Tɔ́a pɛ kyee sis.»<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />É ghɛŋ Yezu nadi eni tɔ boo elɛɛd ɛ, wɔ gwaa mot embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ, mɛ di sama wat nɛ nɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Tin, yɛ kabɛ Yezu ɔɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ààkwyɛl. Nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ, pɛ daa bot bɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ lɛɛ bɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee Ghɛŋ sa dum nɛ tsik'ɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ gek wɔ ghoŋ ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Mot'enɔk eezɛtɔ́, nyɛ moo tin ekɛbaŋa kɔ eghaada kam nadi pɛ kyee dik'enek, dáa Yezu natsik nyɛ ɛ. Bot djas nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ naadyeebadjoka.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ mɔn Zayilus nɛ moma nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ zoob ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yezu eezɛbula pɛ yii kyiid dii tɔ elɛɛd, wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot baazɛsɛɛga é ngwoob'ɛ. Tin, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, é ngwoob boo soob na djato-djato. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zayilus. Dáa nyɛ nabee Yezu ɛ, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, si mɛko mɛ <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />é ɛdjaala nɛ nɛ, nɛ ɛbasal náá: «Mɔn ɛsyes ɛ lam ɛpebɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe. Mendjaala mam ɛ́ náá, wɔ zyɛ zɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɛ, étɛp nyɛ neetsak, da nyɛ ɛ́ baadi nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yezu eezɛtɔ́ bɛ nɛ nɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot eezɛdu nyɛ, bak etuma nyɛ é nyel nɛ ɛtiidal nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma nadi nɛ ɛbɛ́ zoob, ghiya nadi ekekɛk nyɛ ààbɛ nɛ ɛtsek ɔ, ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak naasa nɛ nɛ tyee membu kam nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ye nabela ɛ́, nyɛ naazekɛ nɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ tak tɔ mendjaa mɛ mɛgwoma ɛbuɛpe, epata si nyɛ pum, nyɛy ààtsak. Yenek djas nakɛgheghɛɛ nyɛ ɛbɛ́ ɛ́ ghɛɛak. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Dáa moma yenɔk zɛgwak menduk ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, nyɛ moo du Yezu bhii koŋ, nyɛ eezɛmɛt kyee ɛghɔ ɛ kaad ɛ Yezu wat <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naake tɔ lyem'ɛ náá: «Mɛ zomɛt kaad'ɛ ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpetsak!» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Tin, mɛta nyɛ nazomɛt ɛ, é di tak wat, nyɛ eezɛbee náá, nyɛ eetsak. Ghiya eezɛkat ɛkwyil nyɛ. Nyɛ moo ɛ́ nɛ nyel ɛnyɔɛpe.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />É di'enek wat, Yezu eezɛgu náá, dhiiti mɛbwala eewyis tɔ lɛ. Nyɛ eezɛliigel tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ dji bɛ náá: «Ɛzɛ mɛt mɛ é kaad?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Bɛdjekel bɛ zokabɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ eebee yak kwaambi zukamwaa nɛ mot di etiidal wɔ, bɛdhiiti etuma wɔ é nyel'aak, da wɔ ɛ́ baadji náá: “Ɛzɛ mɛt mɛ é kaad é?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Tin, Yezu eezɛliig mis, nyɛ moo gwyák é ngwoob'ɛ, étɛp nyɛ neebee mot sa deenek ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Moma tak gbegbaagba nɛ bwoo, étɛp nyɛ nadi egu sa nyɛ nasa ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, si mɛko ɛ Yezu, nyɛ eezɛmyaal. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ etɛp djas sael ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lam, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔ nɛ Zɛɛb eetsik wɔ. Tɔ́a ɛnyɔɛpe, wɔ eezetsak.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Tinaak, Yezu dinaa elii, bot eezɛdus pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, zɛlɛɛ Zayiilus náá: «Ɛsyes ɛ lɔ eezepɛka, nàkabaadhek lyoel.» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yezu nabɛ ààbis sa bɛ nadi elii ɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda náá: «Nàbem ba. Duma koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛlu bot djas náá, bɛ nàdu nyɛ. Nyɛ nazotɔ́ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd, nɛ Zak bɛ nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg Zaŋ. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ daa kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bela tin bhwak metetel nɛ mɛgwyɛ, nɛ etaŋal nɛ etsim. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nyɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kwaambi ɛtap nɛ mɛgwyɛ? Mɔn ààpagwyɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́, é gɔ.» <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus guérit la maladie de la fille de Jairus" file="DN00437b.tif" size="col" loc="5.39" copy="Darwin Dunham. © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5.39">Yezu eetsik ɛsyes ɛ Zayilus</figure><verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Wɔ gwaa, bot zokagɔ nyɛ. Nyɛ eezɛwyisal bot djas pɛ kel. Nyɛ nakalik tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ́, bɛ nɛ sɛɛg, nɛ nyɛɛg mɔn, zɛnɔɔ bɛdjekel bɛ. Bɛ eezɛni tɔ dhɛŋ mɔn tak nadi ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «<char style="sc">Talita kumi</char>!» Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá: «Mɔn moma! Mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́, wyɛla!»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />É di tak wat, mɔn moma yenɔk eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ moo ekɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ membu tyee kam nɛ ebá. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bot naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yezu eezɛlyak bɛ náá, bɛ nàlɛɛ bot. Bhii tak nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛ náá, bɛ djɛ mɔn tak edee e dek.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛ Nazalɛt ààmyaal Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yezu eezɛdus pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ sama wat bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ pɛ Nazalɛt ghaada nyɛ nawyee kɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Dwoo saba, nyɛ nadi elyo bot tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɔ naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe. Bɔɔ ekeke náá: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kwaambi ɛlyo ɛ bot? Ɛzɛ djɛ nyɛ mbi yak etsoŋ nɛ endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ'aak? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ye tok nyɛy di salpande, mɔn Maali, mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Zak bɛ nɛ Zozɛs, nɛ Zuud, zɛnɔɔ Simɔŋ é? Bɛkɛl tok wak mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ?» Yenek djas naasa náá, nyɛ di tyee boo ɛbɛk dum nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dyeebaduwalaa ɛ́, pɛ kyee sis, ààbɛ pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ nyɛ nabyel kɔ tak ɛ, nɛghu tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ nɛ tɔ bil'ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa dhiiti ndem mɛbwala, bhii yii nyɛ nazokɛl bɛdhiiti membel mɛmbɔ da bɛ ɛ́ tsak ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Nyɛ nadi edjoka dáa bot ɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ nadi ààdum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Lwomel bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Bhii tak, Yezu naazɛkɛ elyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ mɛl mɛ nadi é ngwoob dɛl ɛ lɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Nyɛ eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ eezɛkyeed bɛ bɛbá-bɛbá. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛdjɛ bɛ eghɛŋ kɔ embee esisim. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Nyɛ eezɛlu bɛ náá: «Sa mot àànɔɔ sonok wat, nyɛ neetɔ́ nɛ yɛ mɛdjoŋ. Bi zotɔ́ ɛ́, nɛ sek. Sa mot àànɔɔ mapa, àànɔɔ ɛkoo, àànɔɔ-nɔŋak meea tɔ mengwyɛ men. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Bɔtka bɛmɛpapa, sa mot àànɔɔ dhiiti kuwa étɛp ɛkɛswoola penek.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Nyɛ eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ kum dhiiti di ɔɔ, dika tɔ ndjaa bi aasulal ɛ. Dika é di'enek kɛkum dwoo bi aadus tin ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Bot ɛ dɛl ɛpɛɛ náá, bi nàsulal pɛ daa lɔɔ ɔ, nɛghu bɛ kapɛɛ ɛ́ ɛgwak bin ɔ, kpaaka yebɔ, da bi ɛ́ kut bɛ piib di é mɛko men ɛ. Yɛ aadi ɛ́, tyee mwana étɛp embee esesɛɛ bɔɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́, kɛgoola nɛ bot djas náá, bɛ liig elyem. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bɔɔ zokasɔ bɛtɛ nɛ embee esisim. Bɛtɛ nɛ membel naatsak, bhii bɛ nadi elɔɔb bɛ mul ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ghuna ye nabɛ ɛ́, Mɛkoozi Eelood naagwak menduk ɛ Yezu etɛɛ náá, dék'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́, yɛ eezedjala mɛl djas. Bɛdhiiti bot nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá: «Zaŋ Nduuel-bot naagwyɛ, gom. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ di esa bɛtɛ nɛ yenek endem e mɛbwala.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bak náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, Eli!» Yak kyee bot náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, dáa dhiiti ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb na mwa!» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Dáa Eelood nagwak sa bot nadi elii-lii kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Yɛ bɛ Zaŋ ɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naazelwom náá, nyɛ tsakaa, nyɛy ɛ́ baagom e!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ye nabɛ ɛ́, Eelood naalwom náá, bɛ mɛt Zaŋ kɔɔl nyɛ é membok kɔ ɛsu ɛ Eeloodhiaad, mwaa tel Filip, nyɛ nadɛk ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ naake nɛ Eelood náá: «Yɛ ààgoka náá, wɔ dɛk mwaa mɔn-nyoog!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Eeloodhiaad nadi ebhina Zaŋ ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛ nadi esaa dáa nyɛ aasa étɛp nyɛ neegó nyɛ. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ààbela ghwyil ɛsa. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Eelood nadi ekaab Zaŋ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi egu náá, Zaŋ nadi ɛ́ mot edɛɛ nɛ epiki. Nyɛ nabɛ ààkwyɛl náá, nyɛ góaa. Nyɛ nadi ekwyekwyɛl ɛgwak mɛlyo mɛ ɛbuɛpe, ye nakoozodi náá, mɛlyo mɛ tak naadyeebadhedheeg nyɛ mɛsel ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Tinaak, dwoo ɛbyoŋ ɛ Eelood di eduwal dwoo ɛbyel ɛ lɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ nɛ Helodhiaad ɛ́ mbɛɛ ɛwala étɛp nyɛ neesa sa lyem'ɛ nadi ekwos ɛsa ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Eelood naadjóo bɛtɛ nɛ ekukuma di esa mɛsa bɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɔ, nɛ ekukuma e esodja bɛ, nɛ boo bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalile, bɛ zɛdɛ pɛ daa lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Tin, ɛsyes ɛ Eeloodhiaad eezɛtuula kuku ɛbwak, tɔ koo ndjaa é di bot nadi edɛ ɔ. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo bɔl é mis ɛ Eelood. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Eelood nɛ bɛdjoŋ bɛ naadyeebamyaala nɛ ko zɛŋ tak ɛbuɛpe. Tinaak, Mɛkoozi Eelood ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ ɛsyes ɛ moma tak náá: «Waaba sa lyem'ɔ kwyɛl ɛ, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Nyɛ nake nɛ nɛ deenek ɛ́, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ lyem wat: «Mɛ eetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mam! Sa wɔ waawaab ɛ, mɛ waadjɛ wɔ, ye nakoozodi pes ɛyoŋ ɛ lam.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Ɛsyes ɛlenɔk eezɛwyis, kɛdji nyɛɛg: «Mɛ waab yé?» Wɔ gwaa, nyɛɛg zɛbɔɔza náá: «Waaba lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ɛsyes eezɛsik kaab pɛ daa Mɛkoozi Eelood. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, wɔ djɛ mɛ nenak yak lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot kɛla kɔ pɛt kongo na pyaaz!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Wɔ gwaa, ye sa Mɛkoozi Eelood nyel wɔyɔŋ nɛ ghoŋ. Tin nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ dáa nyɛ pɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naazetuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ é mis mɛ bɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛlwom sodja di ebaal nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ tsaal lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot, da nyɛ ɛ́ zyɛ nɛ yɛ. É di'enek, sodja ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa membok, kɛtsaal lo ɛ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zyɛ nɛ lo tak kɔ pɛt kongo, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ ɛsyes ɛ moma yenɔk, ɛsyes ɛ tak ɛ́ boonɔɔ yɛ, kɛdjɛ nɛ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Dáa bɛdjekel ɛ Zaŋ nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ muu'ɛ, kɛdel tɔ ɛvit.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdjɛ botom bɛmil ɛtɛn edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bhis ɛbula ɛ lɔɔ, bot ɛ lwoma eezɛboma pɛ daa Yezu, bɛ moo tin ebaŋa nyɛ esesɛɛ bɛ nasa ɛ, nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nadi elyo ɛ djas. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Tinaak, bot ɛ nadi ezyɛ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi esik ɔ naadyeebabu, ààbɛ nɛ ɛwala di náá, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ dɛ edee. Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Dhaka, mena tɔ́ka pɛ kasak di etseta nɛ bot ɛ, étɛp mena neekɛwalaka batsa.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ tɔ elɛɛd, bɔɔ bɛmet, pɛ bot di ààbɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ghuna bot ɛbuɛpe naabee ze bɛ nadi etɔ́ ɛ. Tin, pɛ bɛ nadi etɔ́ ɛ́ nadi eguaa, bhwak djas zɛsum kaab é ɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee Yezu nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nadi etɔ́ ɛ, bɔɔ batakɛkum é di tak ɛsok nɛ Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Dáa Yezu nasul tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, nyɛ naabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, wɔ gwaa, ghoŋ zɛmɛt nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́, dáa mɛsaa mɛ ebhata di ààbɛ nɛ mbaalel ɛ. Tin, nyɛ moo zɛlyo bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɛtɛ nɛ esonok. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Dáa bɛ nabee náá, dwoo moo ɛ́ bikoko ɛ, bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Dwoo eezeleega, tɔ kakoŋ'ak, ye tok nɛ dɛl. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Swaala bot bak pɛ bɔɔ mɛl nɛ pɛ tɔ epɛt ee di é mengwoob'aak, bɛ neekɛbɔm edee e dek!» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka bɛ edee biyɔ bɛmet!» Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bis kɛbɔm emapa di edhenye bɛdhet-ɛbá (200) étɛp bis needjɛ bot bak bɛ needɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛ tɔ mɛkana Mɛkpa Zɛɛb nakwyalaa sok ɛ, bɛ ke ɛ́ 200 dhenye. Ye kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ efute epata mɛsa mɛ bɛngɔn ɛtɛn nɛ ebá.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boobaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ emapa edhen? Pookokɛgwyákeka.» Bhii bɛ kakɛgwyák ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nyɛ náá: «Emapa etɛn nɛ bɛsu ɛbá.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá, bɛ dil bot djas mendiindil, mɛbwak nɛ mɛbwak kɔ ebes eka. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Wɔ gwaa, bot zɛdisi zɛɛga lɔɔg bot dhet (100), bak mɛkam-mɛtɛn (50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ emapa nɛ bɛsu binek, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛpyak mapa, nɔɔ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ etɛɛ náá, bɛ needjɛ bot ɛ bɛ nanɛɛg mendiindil ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bɛsu ɛbá bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Mot nɛ mot naadɛ, djil. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Bɛdjekel bula nɛ mɛbhubhwak mɛ ebil e emapa nɛ bɛsu ɛ́ nalik ɛ, sa yɛ aalwoodal mɛbhwaa kam nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Tɔ bot ɛ nadɛ emapa binek ɔ, botom nadi ɛ́, bɛmil ɛtɛn (5 000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛkɛ kɔ dii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ààkobɔya bhii tak'enek, Yezu eezɛbesal bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ ni tɔ elɛɛd, da bɛ ɛ́ tsaal, tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid boo soob, pɛ kyee ghaada Bhɛtsaida. É di tak wat, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet eezɛswaal zukamwaa nɛ bot binɔk, bɛ sik pɛ yɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Bhii nyɛ nasilal ɛswaal bɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbyet kɔ ɛtsok, kɛdjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Dáa ɛgwyitok nabɛ, ye moo egwyiidela ɛ, elɛɛd nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo kuku dii. Tin, Yezu nalik ɛ nyɛ ɛmet pɛ kyiid. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Dáa nyɛ nabee náá, bɛdjekel bɛ nadi ezuk é ɛduk, etɛɛ náá, pup nadi ebulal bɛ pɛ bhis ɛlyelɛpe ɛ. Tin, é ɛwala mɛsik é pum, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdu bɛ, nyɛy é ɛkɛ kɔ dii nɛ mɛko, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naawaadhaa bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Dáa bɛ nabee nyɛ ekɛ kɔ dii ɛ, bɛdjekel nagek ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ dim. Bɛ moo tin etsim. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Etɛɛ náá, dáa bɔɔ djas nabee nyɛ ɛ, bɛbebwol naamɛt bɛ. Batsa deenek, nyɛ moo lii nɛ nɔɔ. Nyɛy náá: «Dika nɛ mɛghaaz. Yɛ ɛ́ mam! Nàdika nɛ bwoo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd. Tin, pup eezɛtyaala. Bɔɔ djas naadyeebadjoka ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɔɔ àànyɔ ɛmɛt ɛsuk ɛ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ nasael dum nɛ ɛbil ɛ emapa ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ elyem e mɛso.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ pɛ Ghenezalɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bhii bɛ nasɛɛ dii ɛ, bɛ eezɛsel é ɛboŋ ɛ Ghenezaalɛt. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Dáa bɛ nawyis tɔ elɛɛd ɛ, ààkobɔya deenek, bot eezɛgwyak Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Tin, bot eezɛtɔ́ kɔ mɛl djas, nɛ é edi djas kɛnɔɔ membel. Bɛ nadidi ebebɛp bɛ ɛ́, kɔ emwaala, kɔ é edi djas bot nagwak lɛŋ ɛkwyil ɛ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />É edi djas Yezu nadi etɔ́ ɛ, kɔ mɛl, kɔ eghaada nɛ epɛt, bɛ nadi ezyɛ nɛ membel é edi bot djas di esɛɛga ɔ. Bɛ nadi edje-djaala nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ bet bɛ, bɔɔ bɛmet zokee-keeak ɛlɔ ɛ ndjookuwa yɛ pɛ si. Tin, bot djas namɛt nyɛ ɔ, naatsak.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo mɛ bɛbhaab nalik ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Dhiiti dwoo eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi naadus pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bɔɔ zokazɛsɛɛga bɛ nɛ Yezu, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naabee bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu edɛ edee nɛ mendi é mɛmbɔ, bɔɔ ààgwyii yɛ dáa etsi di elyaal ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Etɛɛ náá, eFalizyɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas nadi ebaal etsi e bɛbhaab bɔɔ nalik ɛ ɛbuɛpe: bɛ ààdɛ edee, ààgwyii mɛmbɔ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Zɛnɔɔ náá, bɛ dus pɛ djando ɔɔ, bɛ aanàkwaadɛ edee, ààgwyiia. Bɛ nadi eduwal bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti etsi e mbyak'ɔɔ, dáa vaŋ mbi ɛgwyii ebɛɛlɛ, nɛ ba bɔɔ mɛbhe mɛ dyak, zɛnɔɔ esaan.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Wɔ gwaa, eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi zɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bɛdjekel bɔ di ààsa dáa etsi e bɛbhaab binaka nalik ɛ, di elɛɛ ɛ? Bɛ dɛ ɛ́ nɛ mendi é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Sa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi nalɛɛ dum nɛ nen ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. Gwakeka sa di kwyala ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Zɛɛb ke ɛ́ náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">bot ɛ mbyak'ak duwal mɛ ɛ́ duwela mɛkɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">elyem bɔɔ ɛ́ pɛ kyee sis.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Zɛɛga mendjaala mɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">yɛ ɛ́ yii toto é mis mam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">etɛɛ náá, mɛlyo mɛ bɛ di elyo ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">yɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ epuud.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Eza 29.13</ref></char></char></note>”»<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Bhii tak, Yezu baazɛke náá: «Bi byen ɛ́ etsi e Zɛɛb, da bi kaduwal ɛ́, yii bot nalik bin yɛ ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Bi eezedhuugal etsi e Zɛɛb ɛlyelɛpe, étɛp ɛduwal etsi e mbyak'en! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Bela náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Moiiz eeke náá: “Dila soog nɛ nyoog” nyɛ nabaake pe ɛ́ náá: “Mot di ekal sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ góaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ɛwy 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Dɛt 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Ɛwy 21.17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Msa 20.9</ref></char></char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi lɛɛ bot ɛ náá, mot ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg náá: “Beea esa ee mɛ waadjɛ wɔ ɛ, mɛ eekwom yɛ, mɛ needjɛ Zɛɛb ebuwa. Yenek lɛɛ ɛ́ <char style="sc">Kɔɔdban</char>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Deenek, bi ààbet náá, nyɛ kwyee sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bi di ehoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp ɛgoola etsi e mbyak'en. Bi nɛ baasa bɛtɛ nɛ mbi kɔkɔ esonok di enɔŋel nɛ yenek ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ esa ee di edis mot edɛɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛdjóo ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk djas. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ djas, gwakeka mɛ. Mɛtka sa mɛ di elii'aak: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ye tok nɛ sa di ni tɔ nuub mot ɛ aasa náá, mot di nɛ edhuud. Yɛ ɛ́ sa di ewyis tɔ lɛ ɛ di esa náá, mot di nɛ edhuud. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe, bi ɛ di nɛ mɛlɔ mɛ ɛgwak etɛp ɔɔ!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Dáa Yezu nadus tin ɛ, bɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛdji nyɛ sa ɛsuk ɛ kana yenek nadi ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ biyɔ, bi tok nɛ etsoŋ ɛtiibal é? Bi ààgu náá, sa mot di ewa tɔ nuub'ɛ ɛ, yɛ aanàkwaasa náá, mot di nɛ edhuud é? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Esesɛɛ binek ààni tɔ lyem, ye ni ɛ́ tɔ mɔ'ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ kakɛsaaz yɛ ɛ tɔ ɛbyeed.» Tɔ mɛlyo menek Yezu nadi ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ náá, edee djas goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdɛel. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ sa di ewyis tɔ mot ɛ di esa náá mot di nɛ edhuud. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Etɛɛ náá, embee egeka dus ɛ́ tɔ lyem mot. Yɛ ɛ́ esiiza ɛ di lwom bot náá, bɛ sa ɛpam, djii nɛ ɛgó ɛ bot, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ɛsa ɛ ɛzɔ, dɔɔb epata, mbee lyem, mɛkɔŋ, ɛwa lyem tɔp tɔ mɛzɔ, ɛwyeeb ɛ esa e baa, ebyas, ɛbet, mɛlyet. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Esesɛɛ binek djas, egeka tak dus ɛ́ tɔ elyem e bot. Yɛ ɛ́ di esa náá, mot di nɛ edhuud é mis ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjoŋ moma eedum koŋ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yezu eezɛdus tin, tɔ pɛ kyee dik Tiid. Nyɛ eezɛni tɔ dhiiti ndjaa, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl náá, bot gu náá, nyɛ ɛ́ tin. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjala náá, mot dáa nyɛy di sɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma, mbee sisim nadi edhek ɛsyes ɛ lɛ. Dáa nyɛ nagwak menduk ɛ Yezu ɛ, nyɛ eezɛzyɛ kaab pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛy zokazɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, sok bhwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Moma tak nabɛ ààbɛ moma mbyak eYuda. Nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ pɛ dɛl Fenisi pɛ kyee dik Siili. Nyɛ eezɛdjaala nɛ Yezu náá, nyɛ sɔ mbee sisim nadi tɔ nyel mɔn'ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Beta, bɔn pookodɛ, djil. Etɛɛ náá, mapa bɔn di goka nɛ ɛdɛ ɛ, yɛ àànyɔ, ye mwasaa, djɛaa bɔn bɛbhyɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Wɔ gwaa moma yenɔk baazɛpesal náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ gham. Ye goka ɛ́ wɔ gu náá, bɔɔ bɛbhyɛ di si mesa ɔ, bɛ dɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ eghutu-ghutu emapa ee bɔn di kwyital é ghɛŋ bɛ di edɛ kɔ mesa ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ moma yenɔk náá: «Wɔy, moma, dum nɛ yala yɔ, sika pɛ ndjaŋ'ɔ. Mbee sisim tak eezewyis tɔ nyel ɛsyes ɛ lɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛsik pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Tin, nyɛ eekɛbela mɔn'ɛ ndjaasi kɔ goŋ, mbee sisim eezewyis tɔ lɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ bubu mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛdus pɛ kyee dik Tiid, zɛdhaa tɔ́ pɛ boo ghaada Sidɔn, zɛtsaal yii kyee bɔs mɛdhik mɛ eghaada kam, étɛp nyɛ neetɔ́ pɛ kyee boo soob na djato-djato e Ghalile. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ mot na endiila e mɛlɔ, ààgu ɛlii ɛnyɔɛpe. Bɛ eezɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ kɛl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, nyɛ neetsak. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛnɔɔ mot tak, tiila nɛ nɛ ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwa mot tak bhin tɔ mɛlɔ. Nyɛ eezɛsɛɛ mɛtel, zɛmɛt nyɛ djem nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, nyɛ eezɛso bhiyo. Nyɛy nɛ mot'enɔk náá: «<char style="sc">Effata</char>!» Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá: «Bɛŋela!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />É di'enek wat, mɛlɔ mɛ mot tak eezɛbɛŋel; djem pe eezɛtiiel. Nyɛ moo elii ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nɛ bot binɔk djas náá, sa mot ààlɛɛ mot ngɔt sa sael wak ɛ, yenek nadhedhɛɛg bot ɛ dhɛɛgak. Lyaka nyɛ nadi elelyak bot ɛ, nabebesal bot ɛ́ beselak. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Bot naadyeebadjoka dhaa nyel. Bɔɔ náá: «Esa ee nyɛ di esa djas ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe! Nyɛy batabɛɛ mɛlɔ mɛ bɛ na endiila e mɛlɔ, ebubu batalii!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eedjɛ bot bɛmil ɛná edee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Tɔ mɛlu menek, boo ɛdhuu ɛ bot naabaazɛsɛɛga é ngwoob ɛ Yezu. Dáa bɛ nadi ààbɛ nɛ edee e dek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ bot bak! Bɛ moo mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ mos ɛ́ mɛlu mɛlɛl, bɛ tokapɛ nɛ edee e dek. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Mɛ swaal bɛ pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ tɔ emɔ toto ɔɔ, bɛ waazuk é ze. Etɛɛ náá, mɛl mɛ bɛdhiiti nɛ tseta.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Mena belaka edee ee bot bak djas aadɛ djil ɛ paa, menabɛl ɛ́ dika kuku kakoŋ'aak?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ emapa edhen?» Bɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Etɛn nɛ ebá.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot djas, bɛ disi é bɔs. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ emapa etɛn nɛ ebá binek, zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛpyak yɛ ebil-ebil, zɛnɔɔ yɛ, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ neekaa bot djas. Bɔɔ sa deenek. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ye nabaadi ɛ́, nɛ ba bɔɔ bɛsu. Yezu eezɛnɔɔ yɛ, ghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, bhii tak nyɛ eedjɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ kaa. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Mot nɛ mot nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naadɛ, djil, bɛdjekel bula nɛ mɛbhubhwak mɛ bɛbhwaŋ ɛtɛn nɛ ebá. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />É di tak, bot nadi ɛ́ tyee bot bɛmil ɛná (4 000). Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛswaal bɛ, bɛ sik pɛ mɛl mɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />É di'enek wat, nyɛ eezɛni tɔ elɛɛd bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, zɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Dhalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">EFalizyɛ eezɛwaab Yezu dhiiti ndem mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Tin, eFalizyɛ eezɛkum pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́, bɛ moo be mɛso, bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛlóo ɛ nyɛ pɛ ɛko, da bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ sa bɛ dhiiti ndem mɛbwala mɛ di edus tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Tin, Yezu naazɛgwak ghoŋ tɔ lyem'ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Étɛp yé bot ɛ mɛlu mak di esaa ndem mɛbwala? Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bɛ aanàkwaabee yɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yezu eezɛdus é di'enek, ni tɔ elɛɛd, sɛɛ dii, tɔ́ pɛ yii kyiid.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leviid eFalizyɛ nɛ Eelood</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛdjekel eedjisa ɛnɔɔ emapa. Tin, tɔ elɛɛd, bɛ nazodi ɛ́ nɛ mapa wat ɛ djin. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yezu eezɛdul bɛ mɛlɔ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ bak! Bi ɛ́ kobaka nɛ leviid eFalizyɛ nɛ leviid Eelood<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leviid kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ embee mɛlyo mɛ mɛkɔŋ mɛ eFalizyɛ nɛ Eelood nadi elyo bot ɛ. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bɛdjekel moo tin elii pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ ke deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mena ààpazyɛka nɛ emapa!» <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Dáa Yezu gwak deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi gwyɛ yé, yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi tok nɛ emapa? Bi dinaa ààpasiiza ɛnyɔɛpe? Bi tok nɛ etsoŋ é? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Bi ɛ́ nɛ mis, bi ààbee? Bi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlɔ, bi ààgwak é? Bi ààtaala? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />É sok mɛ napyak emapa etɛn dwoo tak, da djɛ bot bɛmil ɛtɛn, bɔɔ dɛ, djil ɛ, bɛbhwaŋ ɛdhen nabwak nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ebil emapa tɔ tak?» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ bɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Kam nɛ ebá.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yezu eebaadji náá: «É dwoo mɛ nabaapyak emapa etɛn nɛ ebá, djɛ bot bɛmil ɛná (4 000) ɛ, bɛbhwaŋ ɛdhen nabwak nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ ebil emapa tɔ tak?» Bɔɔ náá: «Ye nabwak ɛ́ bɛbhwaŋ ɛtɛn nɛ ebá.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bhis yenek bi ààpanyɔ ɛgu sa ye di kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ mot edhim pɛ Bhɛtsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ Bhɛtsaida. Tin, bɛ eezɛzyɛ Yezu nɛ mot edhim, bɔɔ náá, nyɛ mɛt nyɛ étɛp nyɛ neetsik nyɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus a fait que l’aveugle voit" file="42_Mark8.22-26_JesusHealingBlindMan.tif" size="col" loc="8.22" copy="Gordon Thomson" ref="8.22">Yezu eetsik mot edhim</figure> <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yezu eezɛmɛt mot edhim binɔk é mbɔ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ ba ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ dɛl. Nyɛ eezɛsɛɛ mɛtel, lɔɔb nyɛ yɛ é mis. Bhii tak, nyɛ eekɛl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛpebee sonok é?»<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Mot edhim binɔk eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ ɛpebee bot! Mɛ bee bɛ ɛ́, dáa ele, bɛ ɛpekɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yezu eebaazɛkɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ mis mɛ mot tak. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo zɛbee ɛnyɔɛpe, nyɛ eezɛtsak. Tin, nyɛ moo ebee popoopwon. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ, nyɛ sik pɛ ndjaa, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sa wɔ ààtuula kɔ dɛl.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛlɛɛ náá: Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Bhis'enek, Yezu bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛl mɛ di é ngwoob kyee dɛl Sezaade ɛ Filip ɛ. Ze ɛ ze dáa bɛ nadi ekɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bot ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bɔɔ náá: «Bɛdhiiti ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ Zaŋ Nduuel-bot.» Bak náá: «Wɔ ɛ́ Eli. Yɛ kabɛ yak pak bot ɔɔ, bɔɔ ke ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi ke náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ?» Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza: «Wɔ ɛ́ Mɛsia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɛ ɛ́ Klisto Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ, mot nazyɛ zɛtsik bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ.</char></note> Zɛɛb nadhis ɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Deenek, Yezu eezɛdul bɛ mɛlɔ ɛlyelɛpe náá, sa bɛ ààlɛɛ bot.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkɛn ɛlɛɛ ɛ Yezu di elɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá, nyɛ waagwyɛ, bhii tak da nyɛ ɛ́ gom ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Bhis'enek nyɛ moo elyo bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot zukaa ɛbuɛpe. Bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ́ waabhina nyɛ. Nyɛ waagóaa. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ waagom.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Nyɛ nalelɛɛ bɛ etɛp binek djas ɛ́ mɛpyɛmɛ, ààsyel sonok wat. Dáa Pyɛɛd nagwak deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛdul nyɛ é ngwoob bɛ nɛ nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Nàke deenek.» <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Bhii tak, Yezu zokazɛbulal mis, gwyák bɛdjekel bɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛbiyo, zɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Satan, dusa é mis mam etɛɛ náá, esiiza bɔ tok esiiza e Zɛɛb. Yɛ ɛ́ yii bot ɛ epuud!»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛsa étɛp nyɛ needu Yezu ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛdjóo ɛdhuu ɛ bot, dɔɔ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, mot ɛpekwyɛl ɛdu mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ kat ɛkwyɛɛg ɛ nyel'ɛ, nyɛ bɛp mɛlaaba mɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ du mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ di esaa ɛtsik ɛ nyel'ɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ waasu yɛ. Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot aamyaal ɛsu ɛ́ tsik'ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, nɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela tsik. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Yɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ yé, wɔ bela mɛvu mɛ bɔs'ak djas, da wɔ ɛ́ su tsik na kɔm-kɔm? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Tɛtɛ yaa mbi sa mɛtaŋ etuud mot aadjɛ étɛp wɔ neebɔm tsik? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Mot ɛ gwak sen nɛ nam, nɛghu nɛ mɛkpa mam, é mis mɛ bot ɛ mesyem nɛ bot ɛ di ààkaab Zɛɛb é mɛlu mɛ mena dika mos'aak ɔɔ, tin, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waadi nɛ sen nɛ nɛ é ghɛŋ nyɛ aazyɛ nɛ efofop bɛ tɔ duma Sɛɛg ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ sama bi di'aak aanàkwaagwyɛ, bɔɔ ààbee dáa Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb aazyɛ nɛ eghɛŋ ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛswoola bhwoob ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Bhii ye nadhaa tyee mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ wat ɛ, Yezu eezɛnɔɔ Pyɛɛd, nɛ Zak zɛnɔɔ Zaŋ, nyɛ zokazɛbyet nɛ nɔɔ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ na vyɛɛg-vyɛɛg pɛ bɛ nadi bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛswoola bhwoob é mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ekaad bɛ moo puu ɛkasɛpe, mbi mɛkas mɛ wat di ààbɛ nɛ mbi sonok gekaa nɛ yɛ pɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Batsa deenek, bɛdjekel kasɛka ɛ́ Eli bɛ nɛ Moiiz moo elɛɛ elɛŋ nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, ye goka ɛ́ náá, mena dika wak. Djhoosumka epɛt elɛl: wat yɔ, dhiiti yɛ Moiiz, yak wat kadi ɛ́ yɛ Eli.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ààgu sa nyɛ nadi elii ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛbebwol naadyeebamɛt bɛ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Eguud zokazɛsul, wɔ gwaa, ye zɛkala kɔ lɔɔ, butal bɛ. Tɔ eguud binek, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti gwood zɛgék, é ɛke náá: «Nwyak ɛ́ mɔn'am mɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɔ. Bi ɛ́ gwak nyɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />É di'enek wat, bɛdjekel moo tin egwyák é mengwoob mɔɔ, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààkabaabee mot. Ye nazokalik ɛ́ Yezu nyɛ ɛmet.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiya dum nɛ ɛbula ɛ Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Dáa bɛ nadi ewyeed ɛtsok ɛ, Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Sa mot ààlɛɛ mot sa bi bee ɛ, kana dwoo lak mos, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bɛ naamɛt mɛkpa menek djas, bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ náá: «Nyɛ kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé dum nɛ “ɛgom bhis ɛsyee”?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdji Yezu náá: «Étɛp yé bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi di elɛɛ náá, ye goka ɛ́ Eli pookonyɛl ɛzyɛ ɛsok?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, Eli pookozyɛ ɛsok étɛp nyɛ neezɛkoobal etɛp djas. Haaa, étɛp yé Ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb di baalɛɛ náá, ye goka, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot zukaa ɛlyelɛpe, náá nyɛ waabhinaa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Yɛ bɛ mam ɔɔ, betka mɛ lɛɛ bin náá, Eli eezezyɛ, kabela ɛ́, bot eesa nyɛ dáa bɛ nakwos ɛ, dáa Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di kwyala, dum nɛ nɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ dhiiti mɔn, embee esisim nadi edhedhek ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Dáa bɛ nakakum é di bɛdhiiti bɛdjekel nalik ɛ, bɛ kabela ɛ́, zukamwaa nɛ mot, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi kuku ɛbwak esuu mɛso. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Beea bot nabee Yezu ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadyeebadjoka, bɛ eezɛsum ekaab, bɛ neekɛswos nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mɛso mɛ yé bi di esuu, bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Wɔ gwaa, mot ngɔt tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, mɛ eezyɛ nɛ mɔn'am, etɛɛ náá, mbee sisim ɛpedhek nyɛ, nyɛ ààlii. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mbee sisim tak zoghɛɛ ɛ nyɛ é edi djas, ghɛɛg nyɛ é bɔs, mɛwyil é nuub, mɔn kwaal mɛtsok, mɔn nyel kaada dáa muu. Mɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ bɛdjekel bɔ náá, bɛ sɔ mbee sisim tak. Bɛ ààpakwak yɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Biyɔ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ! Mɛlu mɛdhen kalik nɛ nam é ɛdi tɔ len? Baabela náá, mɛlu mɛdhen mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛmaad bin? Dhaka mɛ nɛ mɔn'enɔk wak.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ mɔn tak. Beea mbee sisim nabee Yezu ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛdheeg mɔn'enɔk ɛlyelɛpe bhuku-bhuku. Nyɛ eezɛghaaga si, nyɛ moo eboola si, mɛdheed ewyis é nuub. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Tin, Yezu eezɛdji sɛɛg mɔn'enɔk náá: «Mɔn'ak moo nɛ ɛbil ɛbɛ́ ɛlak mos mɛlu mɛdhen?» Sɛɛg mɔn nɛ nɛ náá: «Kana edhɔma bɛ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />É dhiiti tyɛ, mbee sisim ɛpezyeegal nyɛ tɔ du, yak tyɛ tɔ dii étɛp nyɛ neegwyɛ. Iyeee! Geka bis ghoŋ, tsika bis, wɔ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa ɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ ke náá: “Wɔ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa ɔɔ”? Ghuna yɛ ɛ́ náá, mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, esa djas nyɛ aawaab ɛ, nyɛ waabela.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />É di'enek wat, sɛɛg mɔn'enɔk eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ eedum koŋ. Kwyeea mɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neewa lyem tɔ ɛmyaal ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Dáa Yezu nabee ɛdhuu ɛ bot ezyɛ nɛ ekaab pɛ kyee bɛ nadi ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbhɛm mbee sisim. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔy sisim di ediyal bot mɛlɔ nɛ enuub ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di eke nɛ nɔ náá: Wyisa tɔ nyel mɔn'ak. Sa wɔ ààbaabula tɔ lɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Wɔ gwaa, mbee sisim zɛbo boo tsim, zɛdheeg mɔn'enɔk ɛlyelɛpe. É di tak, mbee sisim tak eezɛwyis, mɔn tak moo tin dáa muu, sa náá, bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, ke náá: «Nyɛ eegwyɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Tin, Yezu eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, zɛwyɛl nyɛ, mɔn tak eezɛtyaa tetel. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />É sok Yezu nazɛni tɔ ndjaa bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ, bɛdjekel eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Étɛp yé bis di ààkwak ɛsɔ mbee sisim tak?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mbi esisim binek wyis ɛ́, yɛ ɛ́ bɛ náá, wɔ nɛ djaala Zɛɛb ɛbuɛpe ɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebaazɛlɛɛ ɛsyee nɛ ɛgom ɛ lɛ tyee lɛɛa esok ebá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bɛ eezɛdus tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛtsaal kyee dik Ghalile djas. Yezu nabɛ ààkwyɛl náá, bot gu pɛ nyɛ nadi ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi elyo bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mesyem. Bhii tak, bɛ waagó nyɛ. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, nyɛ waagom.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Tin, bɛdjekel nabɛ ɛ́, ààmɛt lo etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ bwoo ɛdji nyɛ etɛp binek djas.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛzɛ di boo-mot?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ Kapɛlnaum. Dáa bɛ nadi tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ, Yezu eezɛdji bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛso mɛ yé bi di esuu ze ɛ ze?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Bɔɔ djas kup, ààlii, bela tin náá, ze ɛ ze bɛ nadi esuu mɛso dum nɛ tɛp ɛgu zɛ di boo-mot. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Tin, Yezu eezɛdisi, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛdi mot mɛkɛn ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ nyɛ di mot ɛbhis tɔ bɛsɔ djas, nyɛ di mot-mɛsa mɛ bɛsɔ djas.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ dhiiti mɔɔ dhyeeb, nɛɛg nyɛ kuku ɛbwak ɛ lɔɔ. Nyɛ eezɛbeedal nyɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Mot aamyaal mɔɔ dhyeeb dáak kɔ ɛsu ɛ kwyɛl nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nam ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mam mɛ ɛmet ɛ nyɛ myaal. Mot ɛ aamyaal mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ààpamyaal mam mɛ ɛmet, nyɛ myaal ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ mot nadhis mɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot di ààbhina mena ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot'ena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Zaŋ eezɛke nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel, bis eebee dhiiti mot esɔ embee esisim nɛ din ɛ lɔ. Bis eekoolyak nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààkɛ lɔɔg wat mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààlyak nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ mot aasa endem e mɛbwala nɛ din ɛ lam é di'enek wat, da nyɛ lii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ nam mɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Etɛɛ náá, mot ɛ di ààbhina mena ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot'ena. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Nɛ mot aazodjɛ bin djɛak nɛghu bɛɛlɛ mɛdii mɛ wat, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ Klisto ɔ, nyɛ waabela efute bɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ na embee mɛfulu eedulaa mɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Mot aakwyesal mɔn ngɔt tɔ sama bɔn zedum koŋ nɛ nam tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bɛ tsel nyɛ boo ɛkok é tsuŋ, da bɛ ɛ́ lóo nyɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Yɛ bɛ náá, mbɔ'ɔ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, tsaala yɛ. Ɛnyɔ náá, mot ni tɔ tsik na kɔm-kɔm nɛ mbɔ tsaala. Ɛbiyo kabɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ di nɛ mɛmbɔ mɛmbá, da wɔ ɛ́ su tsik, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́, kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm di ààdim ɛ. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Pɛ tɔ di di náá, elum ààgwyɛ ɛ, é di di náá, ngel du ààdim ɛ.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Yɛ bɛ náá, ko'ɔ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́, wɔ tsaal yɛ. Ɛnyɔ náá, mot ni tɔ tsik na kɔm-kɔm nɛ ko tsaala. Ɛbiyo kabɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ di nɛ mɛko mɛmbá, da wɔ ɛ́ su tsik, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́, kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɛ tɔ di di náá, elum ààgwyɛ ɛ, edi di náá, ngel du ààdim ɛ.</char></note>] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Yɛ bɛ náá, dis ɛ lɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, wɔ gheekwyekwyɛ tɔ mesyem ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́, wɔ piid yɛ. Ɛnyɔ náá, mot ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ dis wat. Ɛbiyo kabɛ ɛ́ náá, wɔ di nɛ mis mɛmbá, da wɔ ɛ́ su Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́, kɛdyak tɔ du na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Pɛ tɔ di di náá, elum ààgwyɛ ɛ, é di di náá, ngel du ààdim ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Tin, bot djas ɛ́ waadhaa tɔ du mezuk, tin bɛ aakadi ɛ́, bɛ moo gwom dáa mɛsɔn.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mɛsɔn ɛ́ mbɛɛ sonok. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛsɔn moo ɛ́, ààkagwom ɔɔ, haaa yɛ aasaa dáa, étɛp ye neebaagwom? Dika nɛ mɛsɔn tɔ len, da bi ɛ́ gwakel nɛ bot djas.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo ɛ Yezu dum nɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yezu eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude, pɛ yii kyiid dii Yuldɛn. Wɔ gwaa, zukamwaa nɛ mot baazɛsɛɛga tin, nyɛ moo baazɛlyo bɛ dáa nyɛ nazezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, étɛp bɛ neelóo nyɛ pɛ ɛko, bwood nyɛ pɛ kyɛ. Bɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Etsi bina ɛpemyaal náá, mot pɛɛ myɛl é?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yezu kabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ tɔ kiya náá: «Moiiz nakodjɛ bin yaa tsi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Moiiz nake ɛ́ náá, motom kwyal mɛkana mɛ ɛbel ɛ ɛba, étɛp ɛpɛɛ myɛl.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Deenek Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Moiiz nakwyal ɛtiŋ ɛlenek ɛ́, étɛp'en etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ dyeebalyel elyem. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mena bee é ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nakus bɔs ɛ, “Nyɛ nasaa ɛ́ moma nɛ motom”, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ deenek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.6 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mɛk 1.27</ref></char></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, motom ɛ́ waadus pɛ daa sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, étɛp ɛkɛsɛɛga nɛ myɛl. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Bhii tak, bɔɔ bɛbá kadi ɛ́, bɛ moo mot ngɔt<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mɛk 2.24</ref></char></char></note>.” Tin, bɛ tokapɛ bot ɛbá; bɛ moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Deenek, sa mot ngɔt ààbɛk sa Zɛɛb sɛɛg ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />É sok bɛ nazɛni tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛdjekel baazɛdji Yezu mɛdjin dum nɛ tɛp tak. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Motom ɛ pɛɛ myɛl, da nyɛ ɛ́ kɛba moma sis ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ motom mɛzɔ etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ moma mɛgwyak dinaa mot ngɔt. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Tyee wat nɛ moma, nyɛ byen ngom, da nyɛ ɛ́ myaal ɛtɔ́, kɛba motom sis ɔɔ, nyɛ sa ɛ́ ɛzɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eesɛɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb mɛtel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bot zokazyɛ Yezu nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb étɛp nyɛ neekɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ. Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛbhɛm bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Dáa Yezu nabee deenek ɛ́, lyem naakpaa nyɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Betka bɔɔ dhyeeb zyɛ pɛ daa lam! Nàluka bɛ, etɛɛ náá, Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́, yii mot di tyee bɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ náá: Mot ɛ di ààmyaal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb dáa mɔɔ dhyeeb ɔɔ, nyɛ aanàkwaani tɔ tak.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛghɛɛ mɔn ngɔt, nyɛ moo tin ekɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ bɔn binɔk, esɛɛ bɛ mɛtel.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot ekum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yezu gba ɛ gba, nyɛy kuku kyeed, dhiiti mot zokazyɛ nɛ kaab, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, si mɛko mɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mbɛɛ Lyoel, mɛ goka nɛ ɛsa dáa étɛp mɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Étɛp yé wɔ di edjóo mɛ Mbɛɛ Lyoel? Ye tok nɛ mbɛɛ mot kɔ bɔs'ak bhii Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Wɔ nɛ gu etsi djas: “Sa wɔ ààgó mot, sa wɔ ààsa mɛzɔ, sa wɔ ààdjii sa mot, sa wɔ ààlɛɛ elɛŋ e etsal dum nɛ mot, sa wɔ ààsa sa ɛbiyo nɛ mot, duwala soog nɛ nyoog<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ɛwy 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Dɛt 5.16-20</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, etsi binek djas mɛ nɛ duwal yɛ, kana edhɔma bam, kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yezu eezɛgwyák nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl djas. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ye zokalik wɔ ɛ́, wɔ sa sa wat: Tɔ́a, kɛbɔmsa esa bɔ djas, da wɔ ɛ́ nɔɔ epata e tak, djɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. Tin, wɔ waabela mɛvu tɔ gwoo, bhii tak da wɔ ɛ́ zɛdu mɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Dáa mot'enɔk nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛkpa menek naatek nyɛ nyel wɔyɔŋ. Nyɛ eezɛsik nɛ ɛbuk etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ ekum ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛliig mis tɔ ɛbwak, gwyák bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ɛkɔɔla nɛ bɛkum ɛ bot, bɛ ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa menek naadyeebadhek bɛdjekel bɛ ebhum elyem, bhii tak Yezu eebaazɛke náá: «Bɔn bam, ɛni ɛ́ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, tok ɛbɛɛ! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ɛkɔɔla náá, boo yaaga bal dhaa tɔ ba mɔɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ. Yɛ kabɛ bɛkum ɛ bot ɔɔ, ɛni ɛ lɔɔ tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb eebaadhaa-dhaŋak ɛni ɛ boo yaaga bal tɔ ɛlen ɛ dhɔɔ nɛ mɛlyel.» <figure style="fig" alt="Un grand animal du désert" file="lb00039c.tif" size="span" loc="10.25" copy="Louise Bass" ref="10.25">Boo yaaga bal</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bɛdjekel nadjedjoka yenek djas ɛ́ djoka. Tin, bɛ moo edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, ɛzɛ aabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yezu zɛbulal mis, gwyák bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa di náá, bot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waakwak yɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye tok nɛ sa Zɛɛb aadi ààkwak.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd ke náá: «Gwaka! Bis eezebet esa bis djas étɛp ɛdu ɛ wɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yezu baazɛbɔɔza náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Mot ɛ bet sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg, nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg, zɛnɔɔ bɔn bɛ, nɛ bɛkɛl, zɛnɔɔ ɛbhis ɛ lɛ, nɛ epyeeb bɛ étɛp'am, nɛ étɛp Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />kana mos, nyɛ waabela bot ɛ ɛbhis ɛ lɛ, bɔn-nyɛɛg, bɛkɛl, bɛnyɛɛg, bɔn nɛ epyeeb bɛdhet nɛ bɛdhet kɔ bɔs. É di tak wat, nyɛ waadɛ goo kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam. Tɔ tsik aazyɛ bhii yak ɛ, nyɛ waabela tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bela náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di mos pɛ sok lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛbhis, bot ɛ di mos bot ɛ ɛbhis ɛ lɔɔg ɔ, bɛ aakaswaala ɛ́ bot ɛ ɛsok ɛ lɔɔg.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye moo ɛ́ tyee esok elɛl Yezu di elɛɛ ɛsyee nɛ gom ɛ lɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Bɛ nadi ɛ́ é ze, bɔɔ etɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Yezu pɛ sok, bɛdjekel bɛ pɛ bhis nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi edu nyɛ ɔ. Kɛŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo esa bɛ. Wɔ gwaa, Yezu baazɛsɛɛg bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá, nyɛ moo tin elɛɛ bɛ sa aasael dum nɛ nɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Gwakeka! Mena ɛpetɔ́ka pɛ Yeluzalɛm pɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot aakaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee. Bhii tak, bɛ waaka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bot binɔk ɛ́ waaduk nyɛ, sɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é mis, nyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs, gó nyɛ. Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ waagom.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngwyeebel ɛ Zak nɛ Zaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Wɔ gwaa, Zak bɛ nɛ mɔn-nyɛɛg Zaŋ, bɔn ɛ Zɛbɛdɛ, zokazɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu, bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, wɔ sa sa bis aadji wɔ nenak'aak.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa bin yé?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, é sok wɔ aadi tɔ duma yɔ ɛ, wɔ djɛ bis duma aadjɛ bis ghwyil ɛdisi, ngɔt pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɔ, nwyak ngɔt pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Tin, Yezu zokazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààgu sa bi di ewaab ɛ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwak ɛdɛ mɛdii mɛ mbi bɛɛlɛ mezuk mam aadɛ ɛ nɛghu bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛduwa Zɛɛb duwa mezuk mbi mam aaduwaa ɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bɔɔ nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ɛ́ waakwak ɛsa yɛ.» Bhii tak, Yezu zɛbaabɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdɛ tɔ bɛɛlɛ mezuk mɛ mɛ aadɛ ɛ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛduwa Zɛɛb duwa mezuk dáa mam aaduwaa ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Yɛ kabɛ dum nɛ tɛp ɛdisi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam nɛghu pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl ɛ lam ɔɔ, ye tok mam di nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bin edi e tak, etɛɛ náá, edi binek aadjɛaa ɛ́, nɛ bot ɛ ye nazekoobela étɛp'ɔɔ ɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Dáa bɛdjekel kam nalik ɛ, nagwak deenek ɛ́, ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naakpaa bɛ elyem dum nɛ tɛp Zak bɛ nɛ Zaŋ nalii ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Tin, Yezu zokazɛdjóo bɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Bi nɛ gu dáa bɔs'ak di ɛ: Yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ebeeaa dáa ekukuma e membyak mɛ sis ɛ́ di ezuk bot bɔɔ. Mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ di djóoaa eboo bot ɛ bɔs ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyal bot ɛ di eduwal bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Yɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛsael deenek pak'en. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, mot di ekwyɛl ɛdi boo-mot pak'en ɔ, mot tak kodi mot-mɛsa mɛ bɛsɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Mot ɛ kwyɛl ɛdi mot ɛsok tɔ lɔɔg ɔɔ, nyɛ di kwom bɛsɔ djas. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, ɛzyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eezɛliig bot, bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ. Nyɛ nazyɛ ɛ́, étɛp ɛzɛdi mot-mɛsa mɛ bot, nɛ ɛzɛdjɛ bot tsik'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet tyee etuud étɛp ɛpɛk bɛtɛ nɛ bot.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtsak ɛ mot edhim pɛ Yeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ dɛl Yeliko. Dáa Yezu nadi nyɛ moo ewyis bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ tin ɛ, zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi edu bɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot na edhim nɛ engwyeebel, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ Bhaalatime. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn ɛ Time. Nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ ndiindel é ngwoob gba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Dáa Bhaalatime tak nagwak náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtsim náá: «Yezu, Mɔn ɛ Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ moo tin ebiyo nɛ nɛ, ebhɛm nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ needi gwyem. Tin, nyɛ eebaazɛloogal gwood ɛlyelɛpe: «Mɔn ɛ Dhavid, geka mɛ ghoŋ!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />É sok'enek, Yezu eezɛtyaa. Nyɛy nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Djóoka mɛ nwyak.» Tin, bɛ eezɛdjóo mot edhim binɔk. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, sa mɛghaaz. Nyɛ ɛ́ ɛpedjóo wɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Tin, ngbat, Bhaalatime eezɛwyɛl, mwas boo ndjookuwa yɛ, tɔ́ pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Deenek Yezu eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa wɔ yé?» Mot edhim binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mis mam bɛŋel!» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a, ɛmyaal ɛ lɔ eetsik wɔ.» É di'enek wat, mis mɛ eezɛbɛŋel. Bhii tak, nyɛ moo edu Yezu é gba.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ɛni ɛ Yezu tɔ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Dáa bɛ nadi, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo é ngwoob mɛl mɛ Bhɛtfaze nɛ Bhetani, é ngwoob ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv. Tin, Yezu eezɛlwom bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɔ dɛl di pɛ sok'enek. Tuula bi aatuula kɔ dɛl ɛ, bi ɛ́ waabee mɔɔ swooz an tiŋela di náá, mot dinaa ààpago kɔ lɛ ɔ. Tiika nyɛ, da bi ɛ́ zyɛ mɛ nɛ nɛ wak. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Mot ɛ dji bin náá: “Bi tɔ́ nɛ nɛ wo” ɔɔ, lɛɛka nyɛ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Ghɛŋ ɛ di nɛ gwyes nɛ nɛ, nyɛ waabulal bin nwyak nenak.”»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́, bɛ kabela ɛ́, mɔɔ swooz an tiŋela é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa dhiiti mot. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtii nyɛ, zɛsik nɛ nɛ pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ́. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ eezɛdji bɛ étɛp yé bɛ di etii mɔɔ swooz an. <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ dáa Yezu nalɛɛ nɛ bɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛbet bɛ, bɛ eetii mɔɔ swooz an tak. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ mɔɔ swooz an tak pɛ Yezu nadi ɛ. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛkɛl nyɛ endjookuwa bɔɔ kɔ koŋ, bhii tak Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛbuɛpe zɛtɔ́ nɛ ɛdja endjookuwa bɔɔ gba-gba, bɛdhiiti kadja yɔbɔ ɛ́, ebhuuz e ele ee bɛ nadi etsaal tɔ epyeeb ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ngoŋ bot ɛ nadi pɛ sok ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi pɛ bhis ɔ, moo tin edjeeb: «<char style="sc">Hozana</char>! Zɛɛb sɛɛ mot zyɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ mɛtel! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Zɛɛb goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsɛɛ mɛtel mɛ kɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ di ezyɛ yenek, ɛyoŋ ɛ Dhavid sɛɛg'enaka! <char style="sc">Hozana</char> nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ gwoo.» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yezu eezɛni tɔ Yeluzalɛm, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Bhii nyɛ nakazɛgwyák é ngwoob'ɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbee esesɛɛ ee nadi esɛɛ tɔ tak ɛ djas, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá dhaa yɔbɔ, tɔ́ pɛ Bhetani, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dwoo eezesila.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlek le fiigh di ààdjɛ bhum ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Yak mɛlem, é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi edus pɛ Bhetani ɛ, wɔ gwaa za zɛmɛt Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Bɛ dinaa ɛtsetaɛpe, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbee le fiigh nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ eka. Tin, Yezu eezɛtiila si le tak nɛghu nyɛ waabela bhum, étɛp nyɛ neebɔ́k, dɛ. Dáa nyɛ nakakum si le ɛ, nyɛ ààpakabela sonok. Nyɛ kabela ɛ́, eka nɛ eka, etɛɛ náá, yɛ mbu nyɛ di edjɛ bhum ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́, ààdjala. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Tin, Yezu eezɛke nɛ le tak náá: «Kana dwoo pan mos'ak, wɔ aanàkwaakabaawum!» Bɛdjekel bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ egwak etɛp binek djas.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsɔ bot ɛ di bɔmsa esa pɛ tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Bɛ eezɛkum pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Nyɛ eezɛni é ɛsɔ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa esa bɔɔ ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebɔm-bɔmak ɔ nadi tin ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛwaaz emesa bɛ nadi eswoola epata kɔ tak ɛ, nɛ mɛbhóó mɛ bot ɛ nadi ebɔmsa mɛghum ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ ààbet náá, mot tsaal kok Ndjaa-ebuwa nɛ sa wat é mbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Bhii tak, nyɛ moo elyo bɛ: «Tɔ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, ye tok kwyala náá: “Ndjaŋ'am aadjóoaa ɛ́, ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, étɛp bot ɛ membyak djas é”? Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi eezesa náá, ye di zɛɛga bot ɛ djii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7.11</ref></char></char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Tin, wɔ gwaa etɛp binek djas kum tɔ mɛlɔ mɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. Bɛ moo tin esaa dáa bɛ aasa étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ɛ́, nɛ bwoo dáa bɛ nadi ebee náá mɛlyo mɛ naadyeebakwyekwyɛsa tɔ elyem e bot ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Dáa dwoo nakabɛ yɛ eezesila ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ zokazɛwyis, tɔ́.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Syeela le fiigh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Tɔ mɛlem kɛɛŋ dáa bɛ nakadhaa é ze'enek ɛ, bɛ kabela ɛ́, le fiigh eezesyee dɔɔ nɛ ekaŋal. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛtaala sa nasael koko é di'enek ɛ. Nyɛy nɛ Yezu náá: «Lyoel! Gwyáka le fiigh wɔ nalek koko ɛ. Yɛ eezesyee!» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Dumka koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Mot ɛ ke nɛ ɛtsok ɛlak: “Ghɛɛa nyel tin, dusa, kɛghaaga tɔ dii mɛsɔn” ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɛ náá, mot tak tok nɛ mɛso tɔ lyem ɔɔ, nyɛ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, djas nyɛ aake ɛ, yɛ waasael étɛp'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di eke nɛ nen náá: É sok bi di edjaala étɛp ɛwaab sonok ɛ, dumka koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb náá, bi eezebela, tinaak ɛ́ bi aabela sa bi waab ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Tin, bi ɛ di metetel étɛp ɛdjaala ɔɔ, wɔ siiza náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ tɛp nɛ mɔn-nyoog ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ wɔ pel nyɛ etɛɛ náá, Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, neepel bin yebɔ ɛbiyo bi sa ɛ. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Yɛ bɛ náá, bi ààpapel bɔn-nyɛɛg bin ɔɔ, Sɛɛg'en di tɔ gwoo ɔ, aanàkwaapel yebɔ ɛbiyo ɛ bi sa ɛ.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eghɛŋ ɛ Yezu dus paa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbula pɛ Yeluzalɛm, dáa Yezu nadi edjaad tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, zɛnɔɔ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zokazyɛ pɛ daa Yezu bɛghu. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bɛ nazyɛ zɛdji Yezu ɛ́ náá: «Kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ wɔ di esa esesɛɛ binek? Ɛzɛ djɛ wɔ eghɛŋ e ɛsa deenek?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ pookodji bin kiya wat. Bi ɛ bɔɔza mɛ ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛ aakalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ bak. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Yɛ ɛ́ ɛzɛ nadhis Zaŋ, nyɛ zɛduu bot Zɛɛb? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ohoo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot? Bulalka mɛ kiya yenek.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Pak'ɔɔ, bɛ moo tin esɔs. Bɔɔ náá: «Mena ɛ́ keka nenak náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb” ɔɔ, nyɛ waadji mena náá: “Étɛp yé bi nadi ààmyaal Zaŋ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Haaa mena kakeka nenak náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ nadhis nyɛ” ɔɔ?» Bɛ nake deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi ekaab ɛdhuu ɛ bot, bela náá, bɔɔ djas nadi eke ɛ́ náá, Zaŋ nabɛ ɛ́ tɛtɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ Yezu náá: «Bis ààgu.» Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ mam pe, mɛ aanàkwaalɛɛ bin kɔ eghɛŋ e zɛ mɛ di esa esesɛɛ bak.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kana bot ɛ mɛsa bɛ na embee elyem di ebaal pyeeb vin ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Bhii tak, Yezu eezɛlii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ kana náá: «Mot ngɔt naabɛ pyeeb vin'ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛpeeb pyeeb tak, pu guk tɔ ɛkok é di bɛ aadi esyal mɛdii mɛ bhum tak ɔ, baasum ndjaa, étɛp bot aadi ebaal pyeeb ɔ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛdjóo bot ɛ di egu mɛsa mɛ vin ɔ, da djɛ bɛ mɛsa mɛ tak. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, tɔ́ mɛdjoŋ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mbu epyeeb e tak di ewum ɛ, yɛ eezɛdjala. Wɔ gwaa, nakuma pyeeb zokazɛlwom dhiiti mot-mɛsa mɛ ngɔt, pɛ daa bot ɛ nyɛ nalik nɛ pyeeb ɔ, étɛp bɛ needjɛ nyɛ yɛ pak bhum vin bɛ nabela tɔ pyeeb vin ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nalik nɛ pyeeb ɔ, zɛmɛt mot tak, duma nyɛ é nyel nɛ mɛbin. Bhii tak swaal nyɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ toto. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Bhii mot sok, nakuma pyeeb eebaazɛlwom dhiiti mot-mɛsa, nyɛ tɔ́ pɛ daa lɔɔ tɔ pyeeb, bɛ eezɛnyuu nyɛ é lo, nyek nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Yak kɔkɔ tyee esok elɛl. Nyɛ eebaazɛlwom nwyak mot, bɔɔ duma nyɛ é nyel nɛ mɛbin, gó nyɛ. Bɛ nabaazosa nɛ bot ɛ nazyɛ ɛbhis ɔ deenek, bɛdhiiti biaa, bak góaa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛtsak ɛ mɔn'ɛ ngɔt nalik ɔ, yii nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl dhaa tyɛ ɔ. Nyɛ eezɛlwom nyɛ pɛ daa lɔɔ nɛ egeka náá: “Bot binɔk ɛ́ waamyaal nyɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duu, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɔn'ɛ met.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Dáa bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb'ɛ nabee mɔn'enɔk ɛ, bɔɔ náá: “Yaweee! Beeka mot aalik nɛ mɛvu mak djas ɔ! Djhoogóka nyɛ. Tin, mɛvu mak aakadi ɛ́, yenabɛlka.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt nyɛ, gó nyɛ, mwas muu'ɛ bhii pyeeb vin.»<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yezu eezɛdji bɛ kiya náá: «É di'enek, nakuma pyeeb vin goka nɛ ɛsa yé? Nyɛ waazyɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ gó bot ɛ nadi esa mɛsa tɔ pyeeb ɔ. Bhii tak, da nyɛ ɛ́ nɔɔ pyeeb, djɛ nɛ bot ɛ sis. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Bi nabɛ ààlaa mɛkpa mak tɔ Ekwyala?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Ɛkok ɛ bɛsumel mwas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">moo ɛ́ ɛkok di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ nyɛ moo deenek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">Ye tok tin mbyok é mis menaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mɛd 118.22-23</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Tinaak, bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, zɛnɔɔ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nadi esaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt nyɛ. Tin, bɛ nadi ekaab ɛ́ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, egu náá, Yezu nalɛɛ kana tak ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. É di tak wat, bɛ eezɛbet Yezu, tɔ́ yɔbɔ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etuud e lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Bɛghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛkyeed bɛdhiiti eFalizyɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ zɛɛga ɛ mɛkoozi Eelood pɛ daa Yezu tyee mɛbhowal, étɛp nyɛ neebela ndjɛ kɔ mɛkpa mɛ met. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, bis nɛ gu náá, etɛp ee wɔ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ. Wɔ ààbem ba nɛ mot, etɛɛ náá, wɔy ààdyeebagwyák sa bot di esa, étɛp bɛ neetela mɛnyel ɛ. Wɔ lyo bot ɛ́ epiki dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Tɔ yɔ mbeea, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot tuud epata e lapo nɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad é? Bis tuud ohoo, bis nàtuud?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Dáa Yezu nadi egu mbee mɛfulu mɛ mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Étɛp yé bi di ekwyɛl ɛwa mɛ tɔ mɛbhowal? Dhaka mɛ nɛ dhenye wat, étɛp mɛ neebee.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bɛ eezɛzyɛ nyɛ nɛ pata wat. <figure style="fig" alt="Denier" file="42_Mark12.15_DenariusCoin.tif" size="col" loc="12.16" copy="Gordon Thompson " ref="12.16">Dhenye</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Yezu eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Kɔ falanga yak, yɛ ɛ́ wak ɛbhwoob ɛ zɛ? Yɛ ɛ́ ekwyala e din ɛ zɛ ɛ di kɔ tak?» Bot binɔk eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ yɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eebaazɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Djɛka Sezaad sa di yɛ Sezaad ɛ, da bi ɛ́ djɛ Zɛɛb sa di yɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.» Gwaka bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ eezɛdjoka nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiya dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />ESaduseɛ, bot ɛ nadi eke náá, bhis ɛsyee, bot aanàkwaagom ɔ, bɛ eezɛzyɛ yɔbɔ pe, pɛ daa Yezu, zɛdji nyɛ náá: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Lyoel, mɛkana ɛ Moiiz lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ bɛ náá, mɔn-nyɛɛg dhiiti mot eegwyɛ, ààlik mɔn ɔɔ, ye goka ɛ́ náá, dhyeeb mot lik ɔ, ba kus myɛl, étɛp nyɛ neekwyiida tel gwyɛ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.19 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Dɛt 25.5-6</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá. Mɔn mɛgwyak eezɛba moma, da gwyɛ, ààlik mɔn. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Mot bɔɔba mɔn mɛgwyak ɔ, kanɔɔ moma bhii koŋ'ɛ. Tin, nyɛ eebaakpaa nɛ mɛsyee, gwyɛ, ààlik bɔn. Ye zokabaasael ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ mot nabaazyɛ bhis yenɔk ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Tin, bɔɔ djas bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá kadi ɛ́ ààbya nɛ moma yenɔk. Bhii bɔɔ djas, moma eezɛkpaa nɛ mɛsyee gwyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />É sok bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, moma yenɔk aakadi mwaa zɛ, tɔ bɔɔ bɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá? Etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́ botom bɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ààbee tin náá, bi ɛ́ tɔ ɛdjak é? Etɛɛ náá, bi ààsiiza ɛnyɔɛpe sa di kwyala tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. Baanɔɔ náá, bi ààgu ghwyil ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bot aagom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, botom aanàkwaakabaaba boa, boa pe ààkwaani mɛba, etɛɛ náá, bot djas aadi ɛ́, dáa efofop tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Dum nɛ tɛp ɛgom bhis ɛsyee, bi naalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ Moiiz sa Zɛɛb nalɛɛ nyɛ dum nɛ tɛp tak tɔ le nagel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">le nagel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eghɛŋ Zɛɛb nalii nɛ Abalaam, tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na mwa ɛ, nyɛ nalii nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ mɔɔ le nadi nɛ ngel di yɛ di ààdyak ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:2-5">Ɛwy 3.2-5</ref></char>.</char></note>, ààdyak ɛ: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam, Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, Zɛɛb ɛ Izak, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Ɛwy 3.2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Zɛɛb tok Zɛɛb bɛmyoŋ. Nyɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb bot ɛ di nɛ tsik ɔ. Deenek bi ɛpebu ɛdjak.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boo tsi na dil-dil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi egwak dáa Yezu nadi elii nɛ bot binɔk ɛ, zokazɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naabee náá, Yezu nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji Yezu náá: «Tɔ etsi e Zɛɛb djas, yaa tsi di edil tɔ etsi djas?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yezu ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yii di dil tɔ etsi djas ɛ: “Gwaka, Yisalaɛl, ye tok nɛ dhiiti Zɛɛb, bhii Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'enaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Da wɔ ɛ́ kwyɛl Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ɔ, nɛ lyem'ɔ djas, nɛ sisim'ɔ djas, nɛ mɛtselal mɔ djas, nɛ ghwyil'ɔ djas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.30 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Dɛt 6.4-5</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Beeka tsi di ebɔɔba yenek ɛ: “Kwyɛla sɔ'ɔ mot dáa wɔ di ekwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Msa 19.18</ref></char></char></note>.” Ye tok nɛ dhiiti etsi di edhaa binɔk bɛbá nɛ mɛdil.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi yenɔk eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ, lyoel! Wɔ lɛɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ ngɔt. Dhiiti Zɛɛb tok bhii koŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Etɛɛ náá, ɛkwyɛl ɛ nyɛ nɛ lyem'ɔ djas, nɛ sisim'ɔ djas, nɛ mɛtselal mɔ djas, nɛ ghwyil'ɔ djas, nɛ ɛbaakwyɛl sɔ'ɔ mot, dáa wɔ kwyɛl nyel'ɔ met ɛ, yɛ eedhaa ebuwa e bɛtit, nɛ esa ee di kaŋaa Zɛɛb ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Dáa Yezu nabee dáa mot'enɔk bɔɔza nɛ etsoŋ djas ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛlɛɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ààtseta nɛ nɔ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Bhii tak, bot nadi ɛ́, bɛ moo ekyee ɛdji ɛ nyɛ ekiya.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Klisto ɛ́ mɔn zɛ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Tin, Yezu ɛpelyo bot tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛ eezɛdji bot náá: «Étɛp yé bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi di eke náá, Mɛsia ɛ́ dha ɛ mɛkoozi Dhavid? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ naake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb nake nɛ Ghɛŋ'am ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Dha disi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">kɛkum dwoo mɛ aalwom bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">bɛ zɛdhaa si mɛko mɔ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mɛd 110.1</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet naadjóo nyɛ “Ghɛŋ”. É yak tyɛ Mɛsia aakabaadi dha'ɛ?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Yezu eezɛdul bot mɛlɔ dum nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɔ, nadi egwak Yezu nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ elyem. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Tɔ mɛlyo mɛ, nyɛ nakeke ɛ́ náá: «Kyeeka bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, bot ɛ di ekwyɛl ɛkɛ tɔ bot nɛ ewolo ekaad na boo mɛtaŋ é ɛlyaala mɛnyel, étɛp bɛ needuwalaa nɛ ɛswosaa é edi bot di esɛɛga ɛbuɛpe ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Bɛ dyeebakwyɛl ɛdi ɛ́ kɔ mɛbhóó mɛ di pɛ sok ɛ tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛ tɔ edi e mɛbyoŋ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Yɛ ɛ́ bot binɔk ɛ di edjii esa tɔ mendjaa mɛ bɛkus ɛ boa. Tɔ mɛkɔŋ mɔɔ, bɛ nɛ kwyɛl ɛdul ɛ mendjaala mɛ na kpɔkɔlɔm, étɛp bot needi ààbee embee esa bɛ di esa ɛ. Epɛ́ɛ bɔɔ aadi ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Djel kus moma eezɛkaa Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛdisi sok ɛbɔɔl ɛ nanɛɛgaa kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ. Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ ekum nadi ewa epata ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti djel kus moma zokazyɛ yɛ sok, zɛlóo yɛ tɔ ɛbɔɔl, nyɛ eezɛwa yɛ ba bɔɔ efalanga ebá di ààbɛ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Dáa Yezu nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjóo bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, djel kus moma yak eelóo tɔ ɛbɔɔl, dhaa yii bot djas lóo ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ lóo wak djas'aak, bɛ lóo ɛ́ eghutu-ghutu. Yɛ kabɛ djel kus moma yak ɔɔ, nyɛ djɛ ɛ́ ɛkwom ɛ lɛ djas.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ ɛsi ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Dáa Yezu nadi ewyis tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, dhiiti djekel'ɛ ngɔt eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel, gwyáka kɔkɔ yak mbi zumal nɛ mbi yak embɛɛ mɛkok é!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ eebee mbi eboo zumal mendjaa mak é? Tin, yɛ aanàkabaalik é di yak ɛkok ɛ wat kɛla kɔ sɔ ɛkok tɔ ndjaa bi di bee'aak. Etɛɛ náá, djas aadi ɛ́, bik, waazel, see é bɔs.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛkɛn ɛ mezuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yezu eezɛdisi kɔ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv, pyeeb tak nadi egwyakel ɛ́, nɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Pyɛɛd nɛ Zak, bɛ nɛ Zaŋ, zɛnɔɔ Andele zokazɛdji nyɛ é ngwoob náá: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Lɛɛa bis, esesɛɛ binek aasael den? Lyaala bis endem e bis aagwyák náá, esesɛɛ binek moo kɔ nɛ ɛsael ɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Dika nɛ etsoŋ, sa mot ààkɔɔ bin. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ waazyɛ nɛ din ɛ lam. Bɛ aake ɛ́ náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ di Mɛsia!” Bot ɛ tak ɛ́ waakwyital ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb yii bot ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />É sok bi aadi, bi moo gwak lɛŋ mɛɛb nɛ menduk mɛ mɛɛb ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba, etɛɛ náá, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, esesɛɛ binek sael. Yenek djas ààlɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛsi ɛ bɔs. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Yak mbyak ɛ́ waaghɛɛ, kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ dhiiti mbyak. Dhiiti ɛyoŋ ɛ́ waakɛghɛɛ, kɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ yak ɛyoŋ. É bɛdhiiti edi, bɔs ɛ́ waakuu, pwom edee ɛ́ waani kɔ mɛl. Mɛzel menek djas aadi ɛ́ dáa endem e mɛkɛn ɛsuula ɛbyel ɛ mɔn. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ bɛmet ɔɔ, dika nɛ etsoŋ. Bi ɛ́ waakɛpitaa pɛ boo kwan eYuda. Bi ɛ́ waanyuuŋaa nɛ eghwyɛs tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Bi ɛ́ waakɛtaŋal pɛ daa ekukuma nɛ bɛmɛkoozi kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam, étɛp bɛ neebela gham kɔ len. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pookogoolel sok kɔ bɔs djas nɛ tɔ membyak djas. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />É sok bɛ aadi etɔ́ nɛ nen, bɛ neekɛka bin ɛ, sa mot ààbem ba nɛ dáa bi aakɛtaŋal ɛ. Liika dáa Sisim aadjɛɛd bin é di'enek wat ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, ye tok biyɔ aakabaalii tin, yɛ ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ paakataŋal é di'en. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg ngɔt ɛ́ waakɛkael pak'ɔɔ é ɛsaŋ ɛ́ náá, mɔn-nyɛɛg'ɔɔ neegóaa, dɔɔ nɛ bɛsɛɛg ɛ bɔn aazobaasa ɛ́ deenek nɛ bɔn bɔɔ. Bɔn ɛ́ waapit bɛbyael bɔɔ, bɔɔ kɛmɛtaa, kwyɛ ndjɛ sɔs, góaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bot djas ɛ́ waabhina bin, étɛp din ɛ lam. Yɛ ɛ́ bot aamaad lyem kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɔ aakwaabela tsik.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boo mezuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«É ghɛŋ bi aabee mot di edjóoaa “etɛp e ɛpes nɛ puluk” ɔ. Bi ɛ́ waabee nyɛ, nyɛ eezetyaa é di nabɛ náá, nyɛ aanàkwaadi sok ɔ. Bot ɛ di egu ɛlaa mɛkana ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgwak náá, bot aadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, kaab, tɔ́ pɛ kɔ mɛtsok. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Mot ɛ́ di kɔ mii ndjaŋ'ɛ é ɛwala ɛlenek ɔ, sa nyɛ ààsul, étɛp ɛkɛnɔɔ dhiiti sonok tɔ ndjaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mot aadi pɛ pyeeb é ɛwala ɛlenek ɔ, sa nyɛ ààsik, kɛnɔɔ ndjookuwa pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Haaa kpaa-ghoŋ dwoo lenek nɛ boa aadi nɛ mɛbum ɔ, zɛnɔɔ boa aadi nɛ bɔn edɛ mɛbel dwoo lɛɛg ɔ! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Djaalaka Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, esonok binek nàkum é mbu kwol. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛlu menek aadi ɛ́, mɛlu mɛ mezuk, mezuk mɛ wat di náá, ye dinaa ààpakosɛɛ sok, kana dáa Zɛɛb nalookus bɔs'ak ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak. Yɛ aanàkwaabaadi nɛ kɔkɔ mbi mezuk deenek. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ghɛŋ ɛpedi ààsa náá, mɛlu mɛ tak di ààdyeebabɔya ɔɔ, pe ye tok nɛ mot aatsak. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ nyɛ nazesɛ́ɛ, mɛlu mɛ mezuk menek di ba bim deenek. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Dhiiti mot ɛ́ lɛɛ bin náá: “Beeka Mɛsia di wak é!” nɛghu nyɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ náá: “Mɛsia ɛ́ poon!” ɔɔ, sa mot ààmyaal nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Etɛɛ náá, bɛmɛsia mɛ etsal nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb yii mɛkɔŋ ɛ́ waatuula ɛbuɛpe. Bɛ waasa bɛmɛvyɛkɛlɛ nɛ dhiiti endem mɛbwala, étɛp ɛkɔɔ bot, kɔɔ dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Dika nɛ etsoŋ etɛɛ náá, mɛ eezedul bin mɛlɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛzyɛ ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Tin tɔ mɛlu menek, bhii mɛlu mɛ mezuk menek, gwyes ɛ́ waagwyiid suuut, dɔɔ nɛ ngɔn pe moo ààkakas,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />ekwyikwyen ɛ́ waadus tɔ gwoo, bil si,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">esa e mɛbwala djas di tɔ gwoo ɛ waadheegel.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />É di'enek, bot ɛ́ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot etuula tɔ eguud nɛ ghwyil nɛ duma djas. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Tin ɛ, nyɛ aakalwom efofop, bɛ neekɛsɛɛg bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ, pɛ tɔ etuma ená yii bɔs, kana pɛ yak edum e bɔs, kɛyaka pɛ yii edum e gwoo.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mɛlyo dum nɛ le fiigh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Nɔɔka etsoŋ nɛ kana yak, dum nɛ le fiigh. Yɛ bɛ náá, elɛɛ bɛ moo zɛbula ebes ɔɔ, eka moo baakwyil é tak ɔɔ, guka náá, mbu gwyes moo kunaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Yɛ ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ pe, é sok bi aabee endem binek moo nyen ɛ, guka náá, ɛbula ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot moo zɛkunaa. Nyɛ moo ɛ́ é ngwoob ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ'en. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ kɔkɔ membu mak aanàkwaagwyɛ djas, esonok mɛ lɛɛ wak djas'aak, ààsael. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Gwoo nɛ bɔs ɛ́ waadum, yɛ kabɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, yɛ aalik ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ́ di egu dwoo ɛsi ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Dum nɛ dwoo, nɛ ɛwala ɛ esesɛɛ binek aasael ɛ, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt di gu, efofop tɔ gwoo ààgu, dɔɔ nɛ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb pe ààgu dwoo tak. Yɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛg nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di egu. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Bi ɛ́ koobaka, dika ndjem etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu ɛlu nɛ ɛwala ɛ esonok binek aasael ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yɛ aadi ɛ́, dáa mot di etɔ́ mɛdjoŋ, lik ndjaŋ'ɛ. Da nyɛ ɛ́ lik bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ ebaal ndjaa. Tin, nyɛ eezɛkaa mot nɛ mot yɛ mɛsa mɛ nyɛ aasa bhii koŋ'ɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ kalɛɛ sangili di é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ ɔ náá, nyɛ lik ebaal. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Dika ndjem, etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu dwoo nakuma ndjaa aaboobula ɛ, nɛghu nyɛ aabula ɛ́, bikoko, nɛghu yɛ aadi ɛ́, kuku pum, nɛghu yɛ aadi ɛ́ é bɛkuu ɛ sok, nɛghu yɛ aadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛlem. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kyeeka, nyɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛbela bin zaka, biyɔ é gɔ́. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ bin'aak, mɛ lɛɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛ bot djas: “Bɛɛka mis.”»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Dáa bɛ namɛt Yezu nɛ ɛgó nyɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ye nakalik ɛ́ mɛlu mɛmbá étɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa di ààbɛ nɛ leviid ɛ nɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak kan. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi nadi esaa mɛpek étɛp bɛ neemɛt Yezu tyee syaab, étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Ye ààgoka nɛ ɛsael é dwoo ɛ ɛbyoŋ, ekaab náá, yɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛkus ɛghuub tɔ zukamwaa nɛ mot dwoo ɛbyoŋ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhiiti moma eezɛso mɛnanas kɔ lo ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Dáa nyɛ nadi pɛ Bhetani tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Simɔŋ na ɛbɛ́ ɛ zezam ɛ, tin bɔɔ kɔ mesa edɛ edee, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti moma zɛni tɔ ndjaa tak nɛ bɛɛb nasael nɛ ɛkok ɛ albat ɛ, tɔɔɔ nɛ mɛnanas na boo mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa naad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mɛnanas na boo mɛtaŋ di edjóoaa naad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mɛnanas mɛ tak nasael ɛ́, nɛ mɛdii mɛ dhiiti le na embɛɛ mɛnuub. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ààpuuzaaa nɛ dhiiti sonok.</char></note> ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, moma tak zɛkɔ ɛlas ɛ tak, so kɔ lo ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ, naadyeebabyen sa tak. Bhii tak, bɛ moo enyiiŋela pak'ɔɔ: «Yak ɛ́ yaa kwaambi puluk mɛnanas? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ye waagoka ɛ́ náá, bɛ bɔmsa mɛnanas mɛ tak nɛ edhenye bɛdhet-ɛtɛn nɛ wat e epata (300)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epata mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ wat lyaal ɛ, mɛtaŋ mɛ etuud ee mot di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛaa bhii mɛsa mɛ tu mbu ɛ.</char></note>, da nɔɔ epata e tak, djɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot!» Tin, bɛ moo ebyak moma yenɔk ɛbiyoɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛke náá: «Betka moma yak gwyem. Étɛp yé bi di ezɛm nyɛ? Sa nyɛ sa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot ɛ́ waadi mɛlu djas é di wat. É sok djas bi aakwyɛl ɛlyaal bɛ ghwyikwyee ɛ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa. Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaakabaadi sama nɛ nam mɛlu djas. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Moma yak eesa tseŋa nyɛ sa ɛ: nyɛ eelɔɔb mɛ mul é nyel, mam dinaa ààgwyɛ, ekoobal ndela yam. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá: Kɔ edi djas Mbɛɛ Bhaadal aadi egoolaaa kɔ bɔs ɛ, tɛp moma yak ɛ́ waakaadaaa mɛdhik nɛ mɛdhik. Tin, bot ɛ́ waataala mɛnyɔ mɛ mɛsa mɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudas Iskaliɔt ɛpekwyɛl ɛzɛka Yezu gha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yudas Iskaliɔt, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ Yezu, naazɛtɔ́ pɛ daa eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb étɛp nyɛ neekɛka Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb naadyeebamyaala é ghɛŋ bɛ nagwak lɛŋ tak ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkɛk Yudas epata. É di'enek, Yudas kadi tin ɛ́, nyɛ moo esaa mɛpek étɛp nyɛ neeka bɛ Yezu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />É dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa di ààbɛ nɛ leviid ɛ, dwoo bɛ di etsak bɔɔ ebhata étɛp ɛbyoŋ ɛ pak ɛ, bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl náá, bis kɛkoobal wɔ di mena aadɛka edee e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak wo é?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Tin, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛkyeed dhiiti bɛdjekel bɛ bɛbá pɛ sok. Nyɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka pɛ dɛl. Bi ɛ́ waaboma nɛ dhiiti mot ebɛp bhe mɛdii. Duka nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />É di nyɛ aadjɛl ɔ, lɛɛka nakuma ndjaa náá: “Lyoel ke ɛ́, bis dji náá, di bi koobal nyɛ yɛ ɛ étɛp nyɛ neezɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ́ wo é?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Tin, nyɛ waalyaal bin pɛ ɛko ɛ ndjaa, boo koo koobela nɛ esa djas tɔ tak. Tin ɛ, bi aasa esesɛɛ e ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Bɛdjekel eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ tak. Bɛ kabela djas ɛ́ dáa Yezu nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkan ɛkoobal ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eelɛɛ náá, Yudas ɛ́ kwaaka nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Bikoko Yezu eezɛzyɛ, nyɛ katuula ɛ́ lɔɔg wat nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Dáa bɛ nadi kɔ mesa edɛ ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ́ waaka mɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ mot bis nɛ nɛ di eduu mbɔ tɔ saan wat ɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Bɛdjekel djas moo tin nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem, bhii tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ ngɔt-ngɔt náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam é?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mot ngɔt pak'en, tɔ biyɔ kam nɛ bɛbá. Yɛ ɛ́ mot di eduu mbɔ tɔ saan wat nɛ nam ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ɛ́ waagwyɛ, dáa Ekwyala di elɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ. Tinaak, haaa kpaa-ghoŋ nɛ mot aakɛka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɛmbee ɛ bot ɔ. Ye nabɛ ààgoka náá, mbi mot deenek byel-byelak!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyel nɛ ghiya ɛ Yezu: kɔminyɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />É ghɛŋ bɛ nadi edɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛnɔɔ mapa, zɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛpyak mapa, djɛ bɛdjekel bɛ. Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Nɔɔka yɛ. Bi ɛ́ dɛ etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nyel'am.» <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus prendre le repas du la Pâque avec ses disciples" file="WA03910b.tif" size="span" loc="14.22" copy="Graham Wade" ref="14.22-26">Yezu eezɛdɛ ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</figure><verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bɛɛlɛ nadi nɛ vin tɔ tak ɛ, baaghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, bɛ dɛ. Tin, bɔɔ djas eezɛdɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yak ɛ́ ghiya yam, ghiya ɛbhɛŋ ɛ nasee étɛp bot ɛbuɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, mɛ aanàkwaakabaadɛ mɛnyok mɛ vin, kana dwoo pan mos'ak, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo mɛ aabaadɛ-dɛa sis tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Bhii tak, bɔɔ zokazɛduwal Zɛɛb nɛ mɛdjeeb. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, tɔ́ pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛlɛɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá, nyɛ waaswonal nyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yezu eezɛke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Biyɔ djas ɛ́ waakaab mɛ mos, etɛɛ náá, tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb, ye kwyalaa ɛ́ náá: “Mɛ waagó mbaalel ebhata, ɛsaa djas ɛ́ waawyɛɛza na gwyiiŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zal 13.7</ref></char></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Tin, Yezu baabil náá: «Bhii mɛ aagom ɛ, mɛ waatɔ́ kɛbwood bin pɛ sok, pɛ Ghalile.»<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pyɛɛd zokake nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, bot djas ɛ́ waakaab wɔ ɔɔ, mam aanàkwaakaab wɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́ náá: E pum'ak mos, ɛsok nɛ bɛkuu nɛ kɔk esok ebá, yɛ aabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ esok elɛl.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pyɛɛd eezɛben gwood, lɛɛ nɛ Yezu náá: «Mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛke nɛ bot náá, mɛ ààgu wɔ. Yɛ bɛ ɛsyee ɔɔ, mɛ ɛpemyaal náá, menabɛl bɛbá gwyɛ.» Tin, bɛdjekel djas nabɛ ɛ́ ɛkpa ɛ wat.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ɛpedjaala pɛ Ghetsemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkum pɛ dhiiti mɔɔ sum di, din ɛ di tak nabɛ ɛ́ Ghetsemani. Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, Yezu ɛ́ booke nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ náá: «Dika si wak. Mɛ pookotiila poon, kɛdjaala Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Tin, nyɛ kanɔŋ ɛ́ Pyɛɛd, nɛ Zak, zɛnɔɔ Zaŋ, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, kɛŋ nɛ ghoŋ nadi ɛ́ é moo esa nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sisim'am ɛ́ tɔ ghoŋ, saa-saŋak náá, mɛ gwyɛ. Likeka wak, dika ndjem.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtiila ba ɛtsetaɛpe pɛ sok, zɛkwyit mɛboŋ si, nyɛ moo edjaala nɛ Zɛɛb náá, Zɛɛb dis mezuk menek sok bhwoob'ɛ, nyɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nyɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Bhaaba Saagam, mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esonok djas. Disa pɛ sok bhwoob'am bɛɛlɛ mezuk mak. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ sael, ààkabɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lam.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel, sik pɛ nyɛ nalik bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ. Nyɛ kazɛbela ɛ́, bɔɔ é egɔ́. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Simɔŋ, wɔ eedja gɔ́! Wɔ ààpakodi mis membek ɛwala ɛ wat é? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Dika, djaalaka Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ zɛkɛkwyɛ tɔ mɛbhowal. Sisim ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlooba, kabela ɛ́ náá, epuud nɛ sa elɛtɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Nyɛ eebaasik pɛ kyee nyɛ nadi sok ɛ. Nyɛ eebaazɛdjaala dáa nyɛ djaala Zɛɛb sok ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Yezu eebaazɛbula pɛ nyɛ nalik bɛdjekel bɛ ɛ. Nyɛ kabaazobela bɛ ɛ́, é egɔ́, etɛɛ náá, mis mɔɔ nadi ɛ́, ɛdilɛpe. É di'enek, bɛ moo yooo, ààkabaagu sa bɛ aabɔɔza nɛ Yezu ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yezu baazɛbula yak kɔkɔ tyee esok elɛl, bɔɔ é egɔ́. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi dinaa edja gɔ́? Bi dinaa ewala? Yɛ eedjala! Ɛwala ɛ Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot moo zɛkaaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mesyem ɛ, yɛ eezedjala. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Wyɛlka, ghɛɛka mɛnyel. Mena tɔ́ka, etɛɛ náá, mot ka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot binɔk ɔ, moo ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ nena.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛmɛtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ye nabela ɛ́, Yezu dinaa elii, é di tak wat, Yudas, ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ bɛbá eezɛtuula nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele é mɛmbɔ. Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zɛnɔɔ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda ɛ nalwom bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Kabela tin ɛ́ náá, Yudas, mot naka bɛ Yezu ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naalyaal bɛ geka bɛ aagwyak Yezu nɛ yɛ ɛ: «Bi zobee ɛ́, mot mɛ aakɛbeedal ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy. Mɛtka nyɛ gbak, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ nɛ nɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Dáa Yudas nɛ bot bɛ natuula ɛ, nyɛ eezɛtiila pɛ daa Yezu. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Lyoel!» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbeedal nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nazyɛ bɛ nɛ Yudas ɔ, zokazɛmɛt nyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Tin, mot ngɔt tɔ bot ɛ nadi é di tak ɔ, naazɛwaal pɛl tɔ pɛp, tsaal ɛlɔ ɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ kabɛ ɛ́ mot ɛzɛm étɛp bi neezyɛ, zɛmɛt mɛ nɛ epɛl nɛ ebhil e ele? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Mɛ tok wak mɛlu djas tɔ len elyo tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, bi nadi ààmɛt mɛ étɛp yé? Sa bi sa'aak, yɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee nakwyalaa tɔ Mɛkana ɛ Zɛɛb, dum nɛ nam ɛ neebela ɛsuk.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Tin, bɛdjekel djas eezɛghuma nɛ ekaab gbes, lik Yezu é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot binɔk. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Dhiiti ngbaaz ngɔt nadi ɛ́ edu bɛ pɛ bhis, zuka nɛ kaad nyɛ nabɛ nɛ yɛ é nyel ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ kaad ɛsoa kɔ goŋ. Wɔ gwaa bot ɛ tak zɛsuu ɛmɛt mɔɔ ngbaaz tak, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />nyɛ eezɛkaab, lik bɛ kaad tak é mɛmbɔ, nɔɔ nyel'ɛ, tɔ́ ben toto syɛɛɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob boo kwan eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu pɛ kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, pɛ di bhoma bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pyɛɛd nadi edudu nyɛ pɛ bhis, batakɛni tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eezɛdisi egɔɔl du, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ebaal ndjaa tak ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda nadi esaa embee etɛp di náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ Yezu ndjɛ ɛ, étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ, bɛ kadi ɛ́, ààbela sonok. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe nadi ezezyɛ, zɛsu etɛp e mɛkɔŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. Saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́ náá, bɔɔ djas kadi ɛ́, ààbɛ lɛŋ wat. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bɛdhiiti wyɛl, zokazyɛ, zɛsu nyɛ tɛp. Bɔɔ náá: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Bis naagwak nyɛy eke náá: “Mɛ waabwak Ndjaa-ebuwa bot nasum'aak. Bhii tak, mɛ kasum ɛ́, dhiiti ndjaa sis. Zumal tak aabɔya mɛlu mɛlɛl. Yiizaag aanàkabaadi zumal mɛmbɔ mɛ bot.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ye kabela tin ɛ́, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ́ napookozyɛ sok, zɛpit nyɛ ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ taŋal wat.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Tin, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛwyɛl kuku ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk, zɛdji Yezu náá: «Tɔ mɛpita mɛ bot bak zepit wɔ ɛ, wɔ ààkataŋal yɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yezu zokadi ɛ́ gwyem, ààlii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb baazɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yɛ wɔy ɛ́ di Mɛsia, Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb sɛɛ mɛtel ɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Tin, Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Hɛɛɛ, yɛ ɛ́ mam. Bi ɛ́ waabee Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake, ezyɛ tɔ eguud tɔ gwoo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Tin, wɔ gwaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb zɛnyaa ekaad bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.63 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tɔ etsi e Moiiz, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààgoka náá boo ghaa-Zɛɛb nyaa ekaad é mis mɛ bot deenek.</char></note>. Nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Dum nɛ yak, menaka ɛ́ nɛ gwyes náá, bot zɛlɛɛ mena sa nyɛ di esa ɛ? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Bi eegwak dáa nyɛ di ebyasal Zɛɛb ɛ! Bi bee dáa?» Bɔɔ djas eezɛbɔɔza náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsyee. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bɛdhiiti bot moo tin esɛɛ Yezu mɛtel é nyel. Bɛ moo tin ezɛbutal nyɛ kaad é mis, nɛ ɛtu nyɛ nɛ ekuta. Bɔɔ nɛ nɛ náá: «Naŋa! Ɛzɛ sa wɔ deenek!» Tin, bɛmbaalel ɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa, moo tin epak nyɛ mɛbhɛɛz.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛkɛla Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />É ɛwala ɛ Pyɛɛd nadi pɛ si kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ, dhiiti moma nadi esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo ghaa-Zɛɛb ɔ zɛzyɛ tin. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Dáa nyɛ nabee Pyɛɛd egɔɔl du é di tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛgwyak Pyɛɛd. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy pe, wɔ nagyegyee ɛ́, bi nɛ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt é?» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛkɛla. Nyɛy náá: «Mɛ ààgu sa wɔ di elii'enek. Mɛ àànyɔ ɛgwak yɛ.» Bhii tak, Pyɛɛd eezɛswoola di, tɔ́ pɛ peeb ɛbɛsɛɛ, tɔ́, kɛtyaa pɛ ɛniel. [Tin, wɔ gwaa kuu zɛkɔk.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />É di'enek, moma tak eebaazɛbee nyɛ, nyɛ moo tin elɛɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, náá: «Mot tak ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bɛdjekel bɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pyɛɛd eebaazɛkɛla nyɛ, kɛla sis. Bhii tak, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ tin ɔ, baazɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ! Wɔ ɛ́ mot'ɔɔ etɛɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Ghalile.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd tɔ ɛkɛla tɛp, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ moo tin etsaal tsuŋ é mis ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ghalal: «Zɛɛb pɛ ɛko! Mɛ ààgu mot bi di eke nɛ nam'enɔk.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Batsa deenek, kuu eebaakɔk tyee esok ebá. Tin, wɔ gwaa Pyɛɛd zɛtaala sa Yezu nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ. «Ɛsok nɛ bɛkuu nɛ kɔk esok ebá, yɛ aakabela ɛ́, wɔ eezeswonal mɛ esok elɛl.» Bhii tak, Pyɛɛd eezɛkɛk nɛ ɛgwyɛ yenek.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu sok bhwoob ɛ Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Tɔ mɛlem kɛɛŋ, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, naazɛboma étɛp ɛdjek tɛp tak. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ boo kwan eYuda. Bhii bɛ namɛt Yezu ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boo zɛkɔl nyɛ mɛmbɔ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa kukuma Pilat. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Kuma bɛ nakum nɛ Yezu ɛ, wɔ gwaa, kukuma Pilat zɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» Yezu eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ dáa wɔy wɔ ɛmet ke'enek.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Wɔ gwaa, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb zɛsu nyɛ zukamwaa nɛ etɛp. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Tin, kukuma Pilat eebaazɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ààkataŋal é? Gwaka etɛp djas di ekeaa náá, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di ekus ɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yezu ààkobɔɔza nyɛ yenek. Wɔ gwaa, Pilat djoka nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />É ghɛŋ mɛbyoŋ mɛ ePak djas, Pilat nabebɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛpel ɛ mot membok ngɔt, da nyɛ ɛ́ wyiselaa é membok. Ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ́ nadi esɛ́ɛ mot Pilat aawyisal é membok ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />É ghɛŋ tak, é membok, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ndiila. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Bhaalabhas. Nyɛ namɛtaa ɛ́ lɔɔg wat, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nabe boo dho nagó mot ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Tin, ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, zokazɛbyet, tɔ́ pɛ daa mɛkoozi étɛp ɛkɛdji nyɛ náá, nyɛ sa, dáa nyɛ boozezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ, nyɛ bet mot membok ngɔt. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Dáa kukuma Pilat nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, mɛ wyisal mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Etɛɛ náá, Pilat nadi egu náá, Yezu namɛtaa ɛ́, étɛp mbee lyem eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />É di'enek, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ moo ebesal ɛdhuu ɛ bot bɛ lɛɛ nɛ Pilat náá, ye goka ɛ́, nyɛ wyisal bɛ Bhaalabhas. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilat eebaazɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi kwyɛl náá, mɛ sa mot bi di edjóo mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda ɔ, dáa?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot eebaazɛtsim: «Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilat eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Yaa etɛp ɛbiyo nyɛ sa?» Wɔ gwaa, bɛ baazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe: «Bemka nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Dáa ye nabɛ náá, Pilat nadi ekwyɛl ɛdjɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk sa elyem bɔɔ nadi ekwyɛl ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boowyisal bɛ Bhaalabhas. Tin, bhii nyɛ nalwom náá, Yezu nyuŋaa nɛ eghwyɛs ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boodjɛ bɛ nyak, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛbétaa kɔtɔ mɛgɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Esodja zokazɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ bil ɛ kukuma Pilat. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdjóo ɛdhuu ɛ esodja djas, zɛsɛɛg bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bɛ eezɛbét Yezu ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa. Bɛ eezɛpyeed nyɛ kɔtɔ nɛ kel mɛgɔk, sɔm nyɛ yɛ ɛ é lo dáa kɔtɔ mɛkoozi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Bɛ moo tin eswos nyɛ mɛswosel mɛ mɛduka: «Mɛ eeswos wɔ, mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bhii tak, bɛ moo tin enyuu nyɛ é lo nɛ le ghwaazok, esɛɛ nyɛ mɛtel é mis, ekwyit mɛboŋ nɛ ɛmalal sok bhwoob'ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Bhii bɛ nazeduk nyɛ deenek ɛ́, bɔɔ zokazɛdis nyɛ ndjookuwa na tɔɔbelaa bɛ nabét nyɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛbulal nyɛ ndjookuwa nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛwyis nɛ nɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eebemaa é mɛlaaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdjɛ dhiiti mot nadi edus yɛ pɛ pyeeb ɔ, nyɛ kwyee Yezu nɛ bhel é ɛbɛp ɛ mɛlaaba nyɛ aakɛbemaa é tak ɛ. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ, mot dɛl ɛ di djóoaa Silɛn ɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ sɛɛg ɛ Alɛkzandɛlɛ nɛ Lufus. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Tin, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Yezu pɛ dhiiti di bɛ nadi edjóo, <char style="sc">Ghologhota</char> ɛ. Din ɛ tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ «Di Bhoobo Lo». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Tin, bɛ eezɛkwyɛl ɛdjɛ Yezu mɛnyok puuza nɛ dhiiti ngwyɛl bɛ di djóo miid ɛ, Yezu eezɛpɛɛ ɛdɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbem nyɛ é mɛlaaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɛlaaba ɛ́ ebhil e ele ebá syaza Yezu nabemaa kɔ tak ɛ, ee esodja e Lɔm nadi gó bot nɛ yɛ ɛ.</char></note>. Bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, zokazɛkaa ekaad bɛ, bhii bɛ nazesa ɛgwyeeg étɛp bɛ neesɛ́ɛ mot aanɔɔ ekaad tak ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Bɛ nabem nyɛ é mɛlaaba ɛ́, é ɛwala etɛn nɛ ená yii mɛlem. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ekwyala ee nadi elɛɛ ɛsuk ɛ tɛp bɛ nabem nyɛ é mɛlaaba ɛ, nakwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá: <char style="sc">«Nyɛ ɛ́ mɛkoozi mɛ eYuda.»</char> <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bɛ nabem nyɛ é mɛlaaba ɛ́, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ djii bɛbá: ngɔt pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ, nwyak ngɔt pɛ mbɔ ɛmyɛl. [ <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ esesɛɛ djas nadi kwyala ɛ, nabela ɛsuk: «Bɛ nabee nyɛ ɛ́ tyɛ ngɔt nɛ bɛmbee e bot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Eza 53.12</ref></char></char></note>».]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bot ɛ nadi edhaa tin ɔ, nadi egɔ nyɛ, bɔɔ esesyaal elo, edji náá: «Heee! Wɔy mot di náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛwaaz kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, da wɔ ɛ́ baasum tɔ mɛlu mɛlɛl ɔ, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />tsika nyel'ɔ wɔy wɔ ɛmet. Sula kɔ mɛlaaba mɛ wɔ di bema kɔ tak'enek!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Tyee wat nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi moo tin eduk nyɛ náá: «Nyɛ ɛpetsik bot ɛ sis, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik nyel'ɛ nyɛ ɛmet! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Mɛsia, mɛkoozi mɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl, kasul kɔ mɛlaaba bɛ bem wɔ é tak ɛ, étɛp bis neebee, bhii tak, da bis ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ nɔ!» Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nabemaa bɛ nɛ nɔɔ ɔ, nabaadi ɛ́, elee nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛsyee ɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Dáa ye nadhaa mɛwala mɛlɛl bhii kuku mwos ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ɛgwyitok zɛgwyiidela kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas, ɛgwyitok ɛlenek naabɔya, kɛkum ɛwala elɛl yii bikoko. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Tin, é ɛwala ɛ tak wat, wɔ gwaa Yezu zɛbo tsim: <char style="sc">Eloyi</char>, <char style="sc">Eloyi</char>, <char style="sc">Lama sabatani</char>? Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ tɔ lii eBhele ɛ́ náá: «Zɛɛb Saagam, Zɛɛb Saagam! Étɛp yé wɔ bet mɛ mam mɛ ɛmet deenek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Msa 19.18</ref></char></char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bɛdhiiti bot pak bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, zokagwak dáa Yezu nalii ɛ. Bɔɔ nɛ bɛsɔ náá: «Gwakeka! Nyɛ ɛpedjóo Eli!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ eezɛwyis kaab, kɛnɔɔ pes kaad, kɔl é bil le ghwaazok, duu yɛ tɔ mɛnyok mɛ na bwaaz-bwaaz. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsɛɛb Yezu yɛ ɛ, nyɛ needɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ baake nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Betka, djhooka beeka nɛghu Eli ɛ́ waazyɛ, zɛdis nyɛ é mɛlaaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Tin, bhii Yezu bo boo tsim ɛ, nyɛ naazɛsil eswos.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa boo lɛmbɛ na pip-pip nadi tɔ Di na Dɛɛ, di ebɛk dhɛŋ nɛ koo tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ, zokanyɛɛ kuku tak, kan pɛ ɛko, kɛkum pɛ si. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Dáa kukuma lɔɔg esodja nadi sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu, nabee dáa Yezu nasil eswos deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, mot'ak nabɛ ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.»<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ye nabaabɛ pe ɛ́, nɛ boa nadi ebee etɛp binek ɛtsetaɛpe ɔ. Boa ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́: Maali, moma dɛl Makdala, nɛ Maali, nyɛɛg ɛ Zak yii mɔɔ dhyeeb bɛ nɛ Zosɛs, zɛnɔɔ Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, boa nadi egyee e lɔɔg ɛ Yezu ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ ɛ nadi edje-djaabal Yezu é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik Ghalile ɛ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti bɛtɛ nɛ boa natɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ lɔɔg wat étɛp bɛ neekwyee-kwyee nyɛ nɛ mɛsa ɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muu ɛ Yezu eekɛwaaa tɔ ɛvit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Dáa ye nabɛ náá, dwoo moo ɛ́ bikoko ɛ, ye nagoka ɛ́ náá, mot nɛ mot kɛ ɛkoobal yɛ esesɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛlem mɛ nadi edu dwoo tak ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlem mɛ dwoo saba. <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Tin, wɔ gwaa dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Zozɛf, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mot dɛl Aelimate. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́, ngɔt tɔ bɛdhil ɛ bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda. Yɛ mɛfulu nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjala nɛ yii bɛsɔ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ ɛbee ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtɔ́, kɛwaab muu ɛ Yezu pɛ daa Kukuma Pilat. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Tin, Pilat eezɛdjoka dáa Yezu naleegwyɛ kaab deenek ɛ́. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjóo mot nadi kɔ elo e esodja bɛ ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Yezu eeloogwyɛ mos é?» <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Bhii nyɛ nagwak dáa kukuma esodja nabɔɔza náá, nyɛ eezegwyɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, Pilat zɛmyaal náá, Zozɛf nɔɔ muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Tin, Zozɛf naazɛbɔm bheeza na puu, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛsil muu ɛ Yezu é mɛlaaba. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛpil muu'ɛ tɔ bheeza tak. Tin, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ yɛ, kɛwa tɔ ɛvit ɛ bɛ nabwak tɔ bat ɛkok ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbiŋal boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nasa étɛp bɛ neediyal ɛvit ɛ tak nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Ghuna Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala, nɛ Maali, nyɛɛg ɛ Zosɛs, nadi ebee di bɛ nawa muu ɛ Yezu ɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="La tombe dans la pierre que Jésus était enterré à l’intérieur" file="43_Luke23.53-24.2_RollingStoneTomb.tif" size="col" loc="15.47" copy="Gordon Thompson " ref="15.47">Ɛvit tɔ gho ɛko Yezu nadelaa tɔ tak ɛ</figure><verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yezu eegom bhis ɛsyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Dáa dwoo saba nadhaŋ ɛ, wɔ gwaa Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala, nɛ Maali, nyɛɛg ɛ Zak, zɛnɔɔ Salome zɛtɔ́, kɛbɔm bɛmul nɛ bɛmɛnanas étɛp bɛ neekɛlɔɔb yɛ é muu ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Tɔ ghooghom mɛlem dwoo mɛkɛn mɛ yenga, bɛ eezɛghɛɛ mɛnyel, zɛtɔ́ pɛ mɛvit. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bɛ moo tin elii pak'ɔɔ: «Bɛzɛ aakobiŋal mena ɛkok ɛ bɛ diyal ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɛ nenak?»<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Dáa bɛ kaben mis, gwyák pɛ sok ɛ, bɛ kabee ɛ́, boo ɛkok ɛ bɛ nadiyal ɛvit nɛ yɛ ɛ, yɛ eezebiŋelaa, ye moo é ngwoob ɛvit. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛni tɔ ɛvit, bɛ kabee ɛ́, dhiiti mɔɔ ngbaaz ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ nɛ kaad na puu é nyel. É di tak wat, bwoo eezɛmɛt bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Mɔɔ ngbaaz tak ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààbem ba! Bi saŋ ɛ́ Yezu, mot Nazalɛt, nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɔ. Nyɛ eezegom! Nyɛ tokapɛ wak. Beeka di bɛ nakɛl nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Tɔ́ka, kɛlɛɛ bɛdjekel bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd náá: “Nyɛ eetɔ́, kɛbwood bin pɛ Ghalile. Yɛ ɛ́ penek ɛ bi aakɛboma nɛ nɛ dáa nyɛ nalɛɛ bin ɛ.”» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛwyis tɔ ɛvit, zɛsum kaab é gbakba etɛɛ náá, bɛbebwol naasa bɛ. Wyisa bɛ nawyis tin ɛ, kaab wat, ààlɛɛ bot étɛp bwoo bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malak nasik nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal yɛ ɛ́ wak. Ekwyala ee kalik'aak tok tɔ bɛmɛkana bɛ na mwa djas.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yezu eezɛtel nyel nɛ Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yezu eezegom tɔ mɛlem mɛ ɛlu ɛkɛn ɛ yenga, nyɛ nakan ɛlyaal nyel'ɛ ɛ́ nɛ Maali, moma dɛl ɛ Makdala, moma nyɛ nasɔ embee esisim etɛn nɛ ebá tɔ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Wɔ gwaa Maali tak kɛlɛɛ etɛp e tak nɛ bot ɛ nadi bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́, tɔ ghoŋ nɛ mɛgwyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Tin, dáa bɛ nadi egwak dáa Maali nadi eke náá: «Yezu ɛ́ nɛ tsik! Mɛ eebee nyɛ!» Bɔɔ djas nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaal nyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtel bɛdjekel bɛ nyel mbi tela sis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Bhis yenek, bot ɛbá nadi esik, tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ lɔɔ. Wɔ gwaa, Yezu zɛboma nɛ nɔɔ é ze, nyɛ zokazɛtel nyel mbi tela sis. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bɛdjekel binɔk bɛbá zokabula, zɛlɛɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ. Bɔɔ ààmyaal bɛ yenek.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛtel nyel nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ kam nɛ ngɔt nalik ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛtel nyel nɛ bɛdjekel kam nɛ ngɔt nalik ɛ, é sok bɛ nadi kɔ mesa edɛ edee ɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛdul bɛ mɛlɔ náá: Bɛ ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Dɔɔ nɛ ɛlyel ɛ lo bɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ, ààmyaal sa bot ɛ nabee nyɛ, nyɛ eezegom ɔ nalɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Tɔ́ka kɔ bɔs djas, kɛgoolaka Mbɛɛ Bhaadal kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mot ɛ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, da nyɛ ɛ́ duwa Zɛɛb ɔɔ, mot tak ɛ́ waabela tsik. Mot ɛ pɛɛ ɛmyaal ɔɔ, nyɛ waabela ndjɛ tɔ epɛ́ɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Beeka endem e mɛbwala aalyaal náá, bak ɛ́ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ nam ɔ: Nɛ din ɛ lam, bɛ waasɔ embee esisim. Bɛ waalii elii na bes. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bɛ waamɛt bɛnyɔ nɛ mɛmbɔ, nɛghu bɛ dɛ mɛdii mɛ dho ɔɔ, yɛ aanàkwaasa bɛ sonok. Bɛ waakɛl mɛmbɔ mɔɔ kɔ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́, bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ tsak.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu eezɛsik pɛ daa Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Bhii Ghɛŋ Yezu nazelii nɛ nɔɔ deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbyet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo. Penek, nyɛ ɛ́ ndiindel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Bhii tak, bɛdjekel naazɛtɔ́ mɛdhik djas, kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Ghɛŋ nadi ɛ́ nɛ nɔɔ sama wat, ekwye-kwyee bɛ tɔ mɛsa. Endem e mɛbwala menek ɛ́ nadi elyaal bot nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nadhis bɛ.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>